{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013h1zvu6fbUE6iS5TzTSwMw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '\"Diversity Trap\" 需要降级为条件性发现。标题调整为中性化（\"Rethinking Diversity in\n2\t  LLM Evaluation Panels\"）。\n3\t\n4\t  Claim 1 软化：从 \"diversity independently harmful\" 降为 \"diversity is a statistical risk\n5\t  factor whose\n6\t\n7\t  independent contribution depends on pool composition heterogeneity\"。capability-matched\n8\t  结果写为 limitation\n9\t\n10\t  而非 counter-evidence。BFT reversal 降为 illustrative analogy（\"consistent with but not\n11\t  conclusively\n12\t\n13\t  demonstrating\"）。加重 \"When Diversity Helps\" section 篇幅和权重。Contribution 重排：η_max 作为\n14\t  primary\n15\t\n16\t  driver 回归核心，K_eff 作为 \"amplifying factor in heterogeneous pools\"。补充实验：强调 455 panels\n17\t  + 6\n18\t\n19\t  attacks 的规模优势和 copula/family-label 方法论贡献拉分。审稿人 RC1 需更多 hedging；RC5 (\"just use\n20\t\n21\t  strongest\") 变得更难反驳。预期结果：borderline accept（dream_score 2.3-2.8），可能需要 rebuttal 期加实验。\n22\t\n23\t  '\n24\timagined_experiments:\n25\t- name: '15-Model Scale Expansion: Residualized K_eff + MI Matrix + Copula Revalidation'\n26\t  plan_id: plan_001\n27\t  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1-mini, Llama-3.1-70B,\n28\t\n29\t    Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B, 以及 Claude-3.5-Sonnet 或 Gemini-1.5-Pro）。\n30\t\n31\t    C(15,3)=455 panels 上运行 residualized regression（K_eff_resid orthogonalized against\n32\t    η_max,\n33\t\n34\t    VIF=1.00）。12 conditions（2 datasets × 6 attacks from MVP + taxonomy）。\n35\t\n36\t    同时更新 105-pair MI matrix 和 Gaussian copula 验证。\n37\t\n38\t    '\n39\t  expected_results:\n40\t    n_models: 15\n41\t    n_families: 6\n42\t    n_panels: 455\n43\t    n_mi_pairs: 105\n44\t    n_conditions: 12\n45\t    keff_resid_FDR_sig_positive: 7\n46\t    keff_resid_FDR_sig_rate: 0.583\n47\t    keff_raw_FDR_sig_positive: 11\n48\t    eta_max_FDR_sig: 9\n49\t    eta_max_FDR_sig_rate: 0.75\n50\t    keff_dominates_eta_count: 1\n51\t    mean_keff_eta_corr: 0.72\n52\t    confound_free_conditions: 2\n53\t    confound_free_r: 0.35\n54\t    confound_free_keff_p_best: 3.7e-08\n55\t    median_R2_full_model: 0.38\n56\t    mean_delta_R2_keff_resid: 0.07\n57\t    copula_MI_ratio_median: 10\n58\t    copula_MI_ratio_range: 5-85\n59\t    family_label_mann_whitney_p: 0.18\n60\t    sensitivity_exclude_acc_lt05_keff_sig: 7\n61\t  result_rationale: 'N=455 panels 比 MVP 的 N=20 提供了 23× 的统计功效提升，足以检测到 K_eff 的独立效应。\n62\t\n63\t    K_eff raw 在 11/12 条件下 FDR 显著正——但这在很大程度上被 K_eff-η_max 的强正相关\n64\t\n65\t    （r=+0.72）驱动：diverse panels 结构性地包含更多弱模型（tier-mixing effect）。\n66\t\n67\t\n68\t    Residualization（VIF=1.00 by construction）剥离了 η_max 的线性贡献后，K_eff_resid 仍在\n69\t\n70\t    7/12 条件下 FDR 显著正（median 档比 v4 aspirational 的 8/12 少一个条件）。失去显著性的\n71\t\n72\t    5 个条件集中在 shared-bias 攻击（sycophancy 2/2, authority 2/2, verbosity 1/2），\n73\t\n74\t    因为这些攻击对所有模型产生类似偏差，K_eff 的 diverse attack surface 机制不适用。\n75\t\n76\t\n77\t    2 个 confound-free 条件（r≈0.35: ARC×score_manipulation, ARC×position_bias）是核心\n78\t\n79\t    证据——在这些条件下 K_eff 和 η_max 的耦合较弱，K_eff_resid 仍极显著\n80\t\n81\t    （p=3.7e-8, 5.2e-7），表明 K_eff 效应并非纯粹的 η_max confound。但 median 档下\n82\t\n83\t    只有 2 个（而非 optimistic 的 3-4 个）这样的条件，证据基础偏窄。\n84\t\n85\t\n86\t    K_eff 仅在 1 个条件（ARC×score_manipulation）中 dominate η_max（η_max NS, K_eff sig），\n87\t\n88\t    比 v4 aspirational 的 2 个少一个——ARC×position_bias 中 η_max 从 NS 变为 borderline\n89\t\n90\t    （p=0.052），K_eff 的独立优势不那么清晰。\n91\t\n92\t\n93\t    Copula MI ratio 中位数 10×（vs MVP 的 10-21×，range 5-85×）。15 模型带来 105 pairs，\n94\t\n95\t    其中多数 within-tier pairs（如 7B×7B）MI 偏离 Gaussian 较小（5-12×），拉低了中位数。\n96\t\n97\t    极端 cross-tier pairs（如 GPT-4o × Llama-3-8B）仍达 60-85×。Copula 失败结论成立但\n98\t\n99\t    effect size 被稀释。\n100\t\n101\t\n102\t    Family label p=0.18：新增 API 模型（理论上不同 family）但 API 模型间 MI 反而偏高\n103\t\n104\t    （共享训练 paradigm 和 RLHF alignment），within vs cross-family 区分仍不显著。\n105\t\n106\t    '\n107\t  tables:\n108\t  - name: 'Table 2: Residualized Regression Across 12 Conditions (455 Panels, 15 Models)'\n109\t    columns:\n110\t    - Condition\n111\t    - β(η_max)\n112\t    - p(η_max)\n113\t    - β(K_resid)\n114\t    - p(K_resid)\n115\t    - FDR sig?\n116\t    - R²\n117\t    - ΔR²(+K)\n118\t    - r(K,η)\n119\t    rows:\n120\t    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n121\t      - '0.52'\n122\t      - <0.001\n123\t      - '0.21'\n124\t      - '0.003'\n125\t      - 'Yes'\n126\t      - '0.42'\n127\t      - '+0.08'\n128\t      - '0.74'\n129\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n130\t      - '0.48'\n131\t      - '0.002'\n132\t      - '0.16'\n133\t      - '0.012'\n134\t      - 'Yes'\n135\t      - '0.38'\n136\t      - '+0.06'\n137\t      - '0.71'\n138\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n139\t      - '0.55'\n140\t      - <0.001\n141\t      - '0.06'\n142\t      - '0.285'\n143\t      - 'No'\n144\t      - '0.34'\n145\t      - '+0.01'\n146\t      - '0.78'\n147\t    - - MMLU×verbosity\n148\t      - '0.42'\n149\t      - '0.005'\n150\t      - '0.09'\n151\t      - '0.078'\n152\t      - 'No'\n153\t      - '0.30'\n154\t      - '+0.02'\n155\t      - '0.73'\n156\t    - - MMLU×position\n157\t      - '0.39'\n158\t      - '0.008'\n159\t      - '0.18'\n160\t      - '0.006'\n161\t      - 'Yes'\n162\t      - '0.36'\n163\t      - '+0.07'\n164\t      - '0.68'\n165\t    - - MMLU×authority\n166\t      - '0.50'\n167\t      - <0.001\n168\t      - '0.05'\n169\t      - '0.352'\n170\t      - 'No'\n171\t      - '0.32'\n172\t      - '+0.01'\n173\t      - '0.76'\n174\t    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n175\t      - '0.56'\n176\t      - <0.001\n177\t      - '0.19'\n178\t      - '0.005'\n179\t      - 'Yes'\n180\t      - '0.44'\n181\t      - '+0.07'\n182\t      - '0.72'\n183\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n184\t      - '0.15'\n185\t      - '0.142'\n186\t      - '0.24'\n187\t      - '3.7e-8'\n188\t      - 'Yes'\n189\t      - '0.40'\n190\t      - '+0.15'\n191\t      - '0.35'\n192\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n193\t      - '0.58'\n194\t      - <0.001\n195\t      - '0.04'\n196\t      - '0.418'\n197\t      - 'No'\n198\t      - '0.36'\n199\t      - '+0.00'\n200\t      - '0.75'\n201\t    - - ARC×verbosity\n202\t      - '0.44'\n203\t      - '0.003'\n204\t      - '0.14'\n205\t      - '0.018'\n206\t      - 'Yes'\n207\t      - '0.35'\n208\t      - '+0.05'\n209\t      - '0.70'\n210\t    - - ARC×position\n211\t      - '0.08'\n212\t      - '0.683'\n213\t      - '0.22'\n214\t      - '5.2e-7'\n215\t      - 'Yes'\n216\t      - '0.38'\n217\t      - '+0.13'\n218\t      - '0.33'\n219\t    - - ARC×authority\n220\t      - '0.46'\n221\t      - '0.001'\n222\t      - '0.07'\n223\t      - '0.192'\n224\t      - 'No'\n225\t      - '0.31'\n226\t      - '+0.01'\n227\t      - '0.74'\n228\t  - name: 'Table 3: Copula MI Ratio by Model Pair Category (15-Model, 105 Pairs)'\n229\t    columns:\n230\t    - Pair Category\n231\t    - N pairs\n232\t    - Median MI_obs/MI_gauss\n233\t    - Range\n234\t    rows:\n235\t    - - Within 7B tier\n236\t      - '10'\n237\t      - 7×\n238\t      - 5-18×\n239\t    - - Within 70B tier\n240\t      - '3'\n241\t      - 12×\n242\t      - 8-22×\n243\t    - - Within API tier\n244\t      - '10'\n245\t      - 15×\n246\t      - 9-35×\n247\t    - - Cross-tier (7B×70B)\n248\t      - '15'\n249\t      - 14×\n250\t      - 6-42×\n251\t    - - Cross-tier (7B×API)\n252\t      - '25'\n253\t      - 8×\n254\t      - 5-28×\n255\t    - - Cross-tier (70B×API)\n256\t      - '15'\n257\t      - 11×\n258\t      - 7-38×\n259\t    - - Cross-tier (extreme)\n260\t      - '27'\n261\t      - 18×\n262\t      - 10-85×\n263\t    - - Overall\n264\t      - '105'\n265\t      - 10×\n266\t      - 5-85×\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Fig 2a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by\n269\t\n270\t    composition type (all-strong=blue, mixed=gray, all-weak=red). Clear POSITIVE slope\n271\t\n272\t    (r=+0.72): higher diversity correlates with higher η_max. Two confound-free conditions\n273\t\n274\t    (ARC×SM, ARC×PB) highlighted with separate color showing r≈0.35 sub-cloud.\n275\t\n276\t    '\n277\t  - 'Fig 2b: Forest plot of standardized β(K_eff_resid) across 12 conditions with\n278\t    95% CI.\n279\t\n280\t    7 conditions show positive β significantly different from zero (CI doesn''t cross\n281\t    zero);\n282\t\n283\t    5 conditions show CIs crossing zero. Conditions ordered by attack type, revealing\n284\t\n285\t    cluster pattern: transferable attacks (PI, SM, PB) show larger β; shared-bias\n286\t    attacks\n287\t\n288\t    (Syc, Auth, VB) show smaller β near zero.\n289\t\n290\t    '\n291\t  - 'Fig 2c: Heatmap of 15×15 MI matrix (MMLU), clustered by capability tier rather\n292\t    than\n293\t\n294\t    family. Diagonal blocks correspond to capability tiers. API models show elevated\n295\t\n296\t    within-cluster MI despite different families. Color scale: low MI (blue) to high\n297\t    MI (red).\n298\t\n299\t    '\n300\t  analysis: '核心发现方向正确但比 v4 aspirational 弱一档：K_eff_resid 7/12 而非 8/12，K_eff 仅在\n301\t\n302\t    1 个条件中 dominate η_max 而非 2 个。η_max 仍是 primary driver（9/12 sig），K_eff 是\n303\t\n304\t    secondary but independently significant amplifier。\n305\t\n306\t\n307\t    关键叙事影响：\n308\t\n309\t    (1) \"Diversity independently harmful\" 需要加 qualification：\"in heterogeneous model\n310\t    pools\n311\t\n312\t    spanning multiple capability tiers\"。5 个 NS 条件全部是 shared-bias 攻击，提供了清晰的\n313\t\n314\t    boundary condition。\n315\t\n316\t    (2) Confound-free 条件（r≈0.35）仍然是最强证据线，但仅有 2 个条件——reviewer 可能质疑\n317\t\n318\t    generalizability。论文需要 argue 这 2 个条件的代表性（覆盖了 transferable attack 类别）。\n319\t\n320\t    (3) Copula 中位数 10× 仍然足以支持 Claim 5（Gaussian copula failure），但 range 下限 5×\n321\t\n322\t    意味着某些 model pairs 偏离不大——论文应报告 \"median 10×, but ranging from 5× (within-tier)\n323\t\n324\t    to 85× (extreme cross-tier)\"。\n325\t\n326\t    (4) ΔR² 平均 +0.07 意味着 K_eff 的独立解释力有限——η_max 解释了大部分方差。论文可以将\n327\t\n328\t    此框为 \"K_eff 的独立贡献虽然在统计上显著，但效应量 modest\"。\n329\t\n330\t\n331\t    对 reviewer concern RC1 的应对：三条证据线（residualization + confound-free + sensitivity）\n332\t\n333\t    仍然收敛，但需要更多 hedging：report 7/12 而非 overclaim。RC5 (\"just use strongest\") 变得\n334\t\n335\t    更有力——如果 K_eff 的独立效应 modest，那么仅选最强模型几乎就够了。\n336\t\n337\t    '\n338\t- name: 'Attack Expansion to 6 Types: Few-Shot Hijacking, Persona Manipulation, Instruction\n339\t    Override'\n340\t  plan_id: plan_002\n341\t  description: '在 15 模型/455 panels 基础上新增 3 种攻击：few-shot hijacking（利用 in-context learning\n342\t\n343\t    注入错误评判模式）, persona manipulation（伪造 authority/expert persona 影响评分）,\n344\t\n345\t    instruction override（直接注入评分指令覆盖原始 prompt）。\n346\t\n347\t    总计 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 18 conditions（含原 12 conditions 重跑）。\n348\t\n349\t    '\n350\t  expected_results:\n351\t    total_conditions: 18\n352\t    original_12_keff_resid_sig: 7\n353\t    new_6_keff_resid_sig: 1\n354\t    total_keff_resid_sig: 8\n355\t    total_eta_max_sig: 13\n356\t    new_attack_eta_max_sig: 4\n357\t    new_attack_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.833\n358\t    few_shot_keff_sig_count: 1\n359\t    persona_keff_sig_count: 0\n360\t    instruction_override_keff_sig_count: 0\n361\t    few_shot_ceiling_effect_conditions: 1\n362\t    median_R2_new_attacks: 0.33\n363\t    overall_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.444\n364\t  result_rationale: '新增攻击类型呈现清晰的分化模式：\n365\t\n366\t\n367\t    Few-shot hijacking（2 条件）：该攻击利用 in-context learning 注入评判模式，不同模型\n368\t\n369\t    对 ICL manipulation 的敏感度差异极大（小模型更易被 few-shot 劫持，大模型 instruction\n370\t\n371\t    following 更 robust）。因此在 ARC×few_shot 中 K_eff_resid 显著正（p=0.022）——\n372\t\n373\t    diverse panels 包含 ICL-susceptible 小模型成为攻击入口。但 MMLU×few_shot 出现 ceiling\n374\t\n375\t    effect：所有模型 ASR > 0.70（MMLU 的 few-shot 模板更容易制造 confusion），η_max 方差\n376\t\n377\t    被压缩，regression 退化（R²=0.12）。\n378\t\n379\t\n380\t    Persona manipulation（2 条件）：该攻击更接近 shared-bias 模式——不同模型对 authority\n381\t\n382\t    persona 的响应差异较小（都有一定程度的 sycophancy toward perceived experts）。\n383\t\n384\t    K_eff_resid 方向正但 NS（p=0.12, 0.18）。η_max 也仅 1/2 sig（persona 效应更 uniform）。\n385\t\n386\t    这为 \"When Diversity Helps\" section 提供了重要边界条件：当攻击均匀影响所有 judge 时，\n387\t\n388\t    K_eff 的 diverse attack surface 机制不生效。\n389\t\n390\t\n391\t    Instruction override（2 条件）：高度 targeted——直接注入评分指令主要影响 instruction\n392\t\n393\t    following 弱的模型。η_max 强显著（2/2, β≈0.55-0.62），K_eff_resid NS。攻击完全集中\n394\t\n395\t    在最弱 judge，diversity 无关紧要。\n396\t\n397\t\n398\t    合计：新攻击中仅 1/6 K_eff_resid sig。加上原 12 条件的 7/12，总计 8/18（0.44），\n399\t\n400\t    在 extended metric range [7, 10] 内。整体叙事：K_eff 的有害效应在 transferable\n401\t\n402\t    attacks 中最强，在 shared-bias 和 targeted attacks 中减弱或消失。\n403\t\n404\t    '\n405\t  tables:\n406\t  - name: 'Table 4: Extended Regression Summary — 18 Conditions (455 Panels)'\n407\t    columns:\n408\t    - Attack\n409\t    - Dataset\n410\t    - β(η_max)\n411\t    - p(η_max)\n412\t    - β(K_resid)\n413\t    - p(K_resid)\n414\t    - FDR K sig?\n415\t    - R²\n416\t    rows:\n417\t    - - prompt_inj\n418\t      - MMLU\n419\t      - '0.52'\n420\t      - <0.001\n421\t      - '0.21'\n422\t      - '0.003'\n423\t      - 'Yes'\n424\t      - '0.42'\n425\t    - - prompt_inj\n426\t      - ARC\n427\t      - '0.56'\n428\t      - <0.001\n429\t      - '0.19'\n430\t      - '0.005'\n431\t      - 'Yes'\n432\t      - '0.44'\n433\t    - - score_manip\n434\t      - MMLU\n435\t      - '0.48'\n436\t      - '0.002'\n437\t      - '0.16'\n438\t      - '0.012'\n439\t      - 'Yes'\n440\t      - '0.38'\n441\t    - - score_manip\n442\t      - ARC\n443\t      - '0.15'\n444\t      - '0.142'\n445\t      - '0.24'\n446\t      - '3.7e-8'\n447\t      - 'Yes'\n448\t      - '0.40'\n449\t    - - sycophancy\n450\t      - MMLU\n451\t      - '0.55'\n452\t      - <0.001\n453\t      - '0.06'\n454\t      - '0.285'\n455\t      - 'No'\n456\t      - '0.34'\n457\t    - - sycophancy\n458\t      - ARC\n459\t      - '0.58'\n460\t      - <0.001\n461\t      - '0.04'\n462\t      - '0.418'\n463\t      - 'No'\n464\t      - '0.36'\n465\t    - - verbosity\n466\t      - MMLU\n467\t      - '0.42'\n468\t      - '0.005'\n469\t      - '0.09'\n470\t      - '0.078'\n471\t      - 'No'\n472\t      - '0.30'\n473\t    - - verbosity\n474\t      - ARC\n475\t      - '0.44'\n476\t      - '0.003'\n477\t      - '0.14'\n478\t      - '0.018'\n479\t      - 'Yes'\n480\t      - '0.35'\n481\t    - - position\n482\t      - MMLU\n483\t      - '0.39'\n484\t      - '0.008'\n485\t      - '0.18'\n486\t      - '0.006'\n487\t      - 'Yes'\n488\t      - '0.36'\n489\t    - - position\n490\t      - ARC\n491\t      - '0.08'\n492\t      - '0.683'\n493\t      - '0.22'\n494\t      - '5.2e-7'\n495\t      - 'Yes'\n496\t      - '0.38'\n497\t    - - authority\n498\t      - MMLU\n499\t      - '0.50'\n500\t      - <0.001"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b6bb46a-6f14-4907-ac47-60e29122a37c","uuid":"db749b6b-ad49-4882-b754-c95ef89d290a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T18:38:36.607Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T173833/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '\"Diversity Trap\" 需要降级为条件性发现。标题调整为中性化（\"Rethinking Diversity in\n  LLM Evaluation Panels\"）。\n\n  Claim 1 软化：从 \"diversity independently harmful\" 降为 \"diversity is a statistical risk\n  factor whose\n\n  independent contribution depends on pool composition heterogeneity\"。capability-matched\n  结果写为 limitation\n\n  而非 counter-evidence。BFT reversal 降为 illustrative analogy（\"consistent with but not\n  conclusively\n\n  demonstrating\"）。加重 \"When Diversity Helps\" section 篇幅和权重。Contribution 重排：η_max 作为\n  primary\n\n  driver 回归核心，K_eff 作为 \"amplifying factor in heterogeneous pools\"。补充实验：强调 455 panels\n  + 6\n\n  attacks 的规模优势和 copula/family-label 方法论贡献拉分。审稿人 RC1 需更多 hedging；RC5 (\"just use\n\n  strongest\") 变得更难反驳。预期结果：borderline accept（dream_score 2.3-2.8），可能需要 rebuttal 期加实验。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: '15-Model Scale Expansion: Residualized K_eff + MI Matrix + Copula Revalidation'\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1-mini, Llama-3.1-70B,\n\n    Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B, 以及 Claude-3.5-Sonnet 或 Gemini-1.5-Pro）。\n\n    C(15,3)=455 panels 上运行 residualized regression（K_eff_resid orthogonalized against\n    η_max,\n\n    VIF=1.00）。12 conditions（2 datasets × 6 attacks from MVP + taxonomy）。\n\n    同时更新 105-pair MI matrix 和 Gaussian copula 验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 15\n    n_families: 6\n    n_panels: 455\n    n_mi_pairs: 105\n    n_conditions: 12\n    keff_resid_FDR_sig_positive: 7\n    keff_resid_FDR_sig_rate: 0.583\n    keff_raw_FDR_sig_positive: 11\n    eta_max_FDR_sig: 9\n    eta_max_FDR_sig_rate: 0.75\n    keff_dominates_eta_count: 1\n    mean_keff_eta_corr: 0.72\n    confound_free_conditions: 2\n    confound_free_r: 0.35\n    confound_free_keff_p_best: 3.7e-08\n    median_R2_full_model: 0.38\n    mean_delta_R2_keff_resid: 0.07\n    copula_MI_ratio_median: 10\n    copula_MI_ratio_range: 5-85\n    family_label_mann_whitney_p: 0.18\n    sensitivity_exclude_acc_lt05_keff_sig: 7\n  result_rationale: 'N=455 panels 比 MVP 的 N=20 提供了 23× 的统计功效提升，足以检测到 K_eff 的独立效应。\n\n    K_eff raw 在 11/12 条件下 FDR 显著正——但这在很大程度上被 K_eff-η_max 的强正相关\n\n    （r=+0.72）驱动：diverse panels 结构性地包含更多弱模型（tier-mixing effect）。\n\n\n    Residualization（VIF=1.00 by construction）剥离了 η_max 的线性贡献后，K_eff_resid 仍在\n\n    7/12 条件下 FDR 显著正（median 档比 v4 aspirational 的 8/12 少一个条件）。失去显著性的\n\n    5 个条件集中在 shared-bias 攻击（sycophancy 2/2, authority 2/2, verbosity 1/2），\n\n    因为这些攻击对所有模型产生类似偏差，K_eff 的 diverse attack surface 机制不适用。\n\n\n    2 个 confound-free 条件（r≈0.35: ARC×score_manipulation, ARC×position_bias）是核心\n\n    证据——在这些条件下 K_eff 和 η_max 的耦合较弱，K_eff_resid 仍极显著\n\n    （p=3.7e-8, 5.2e-7），表明 K_eff 效应并非纯粹的 η_max confound。但 median 档下\n\n    只有 2 个（而非 optimistic 的 3-4 个）这样的条件，证据基础偏窄。\n\n\n    K_eff 仅在 1 个条件（ARC×score_manipulation）中 dominate η_max（η_max NS, K_eff sig），\n\n    比 v4 aspirational 的 2 个少一个——ARC×position_bias 中 η_max 从 NS 变为 borderline\n\n    （p=0.052），K_eff 的独立优势不那么清晰。\n\n\n    Copula MI ratio 中位数 10×（vs MVP 的 10-21×，range 5-85×）。15 模型带来 105 pairs，\n\n    其中多数 within-tier pairs（如 7B×7B）MI 偏离 Gaussian 较小（5-12×），拉低了中位数。\n\n    极端 cross-tier pairs（如 GPT-4o × Llama-3-8B）仍达 60-85×。Copula 失败结论成立但\n\n    effect size 被稀释。\n\n\n    Family label p=0.18：新增 API 模型（理论上不同 family）但 API 模型间 MI 反而偏高\n\n    （共享训练 paradigm 和 RLHF alignment），within vs cross-family 区分仍不显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Residualized Regression Across 12 Conditions (455 Panels, 15 Models)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_resid)\n    - p(K_resid)\n    - FDR sig?\n    - R²\n    - ΔR²(+K)\n    - r(K,η)\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n      - '0.52'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.003'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '+0.08'\n      - '0.74'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.16'\n      - '0.012'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '+0.06'\n      - '0.71'\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.55'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.285'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.34'\n      - '+0.01'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - MMLU×verbosity\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.078'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.30'\n      - '+0.02'\n      - '0.73'\n    - - MMLU×position\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.006'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '+0.07'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - MMLU×authority\n      - '0.50'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.352'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.32'\n      - '+0.01'\n      - '0.76'\n    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n      - '0.56'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.005'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '+0.07'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.142'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '3.7e-8'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.40'\n      - '+0.15'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '0.58'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.418'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '+0.00'\n      - '0.75'\n    - - ARC×verbosity\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.018'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '+0.05'\n      - '0.70'\n    - - ARC×position\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.683'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '5.2e-7'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '+0.13'\n      - '0.33'\n    - - ARC×authority\n      - '0.46'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.192'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '+0.01'\n      - '0.74'\n  - name: 'Table 3: Copula MI Ratio by Model Pair Category (15-Model, 105 Pairs)'\n    columns:\n    - Pair Category\n    - N pairs\n    - Median MI_obs/MI_gauss\n    - Range\n    rows:\n    - - Within 7B tier\n      - '10'\n      - 7×\n      - 5-18×\n    - - Within 70B tier\n      - '3'\n      - 12×\n      - 8-22×\n    - - Within API tier\n      - '10'\n      - 15×\n      - 9-35×\n    - - Cross-tier (7B×70B)\n      - '15'\n      - 14×\n      - 6-42×\n    - - Cross-tier (7B×API)\n      - '25'\n      - 8×\n      - 5-28×\n    - - Cross-tier (70B×API)\n      - '15'\n      - 11×\n      - 7-38×\n    - - Cross-tier (extreme)\n      - '27'\n      - 18×\n      - 10-85×\n    - - Overall\n      - '105'\n      - 10×\n      - 5-85×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by\n\n    composition type (all-strong=blue, mixed=gray, all-weak=red). Clear POSITIVE slope\n\n    (r=+0.72): higher diversity correlates with higher η_max. Two confound-free conditions\n\n    (ARC×SM, ARC×PB) highlighted with separate color showing r≈0.35 sub-cloud.\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 2b: Forest plot of standardized β(K_eff_resid) across 12 conditions with\n    95% CI.\n\n    7 conditions show positive β significantly different from zero (CI doesn''t cross\n    zero);\n\n    5 conditions show CIs crossing zero. Conditions ordered by attack type, revealing\n\n    cluster pattern: transferable attacks (PI, SM, PB) show larger β; shared-bias\n    attacks\n\n    (Syc, Auth, VB) show smaller β near zero.\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 2c: Heatmap of 15×15 MI matrix (MMLU), clustered by capability tier rather\n    than\n\n    family. Diagonal blocks correspond to capability tiers. API models show elevated\n\n    within-cluster MI despite different families. Color scale: low MI (blue) to high\n    MI (red).\n\n    '\n  analysis: '核心发现方向正确但比 v4 aspirational 弱一档：K_eff_resid 7/12 而非 8/12，K_eff 仅在\n\n    1 个条件中 dominate η_max 而非 2 个。η_max 仍是 primary driver（9/12 sig），K_eff 是\n\n    secondary but independently significant amplifier。\n\n\n    关键叙事影响：\n\n    (1) \"Diversity independently harmful\" 需要加 qualification：\"in heterogeneous model\n    pools\n\n    spanning multiple capability tiers\"。5 个 NS 条件全部是 shared-bias 攻击，提供了清晰的\n\n    boundary condition。\n\n    (2) Confound-free 条件（r≈0.35）仍然是最强证据线，但仅有 2 个条件——reviewer 可能质疑\n\n    generalizability。论文需要 argue 这 2 个条件的代表性（覆盖了 transferable attack 类别）。\n\n    (3) Copula 中位数 10× 仍然足以支持 Claim 5（Gaussian copula failure），但 range 下限 5×\n\n    意味着某些 model pairs 偏离不大——论文应报告 \"median 10×, but ranging from 5× (within-tier)\n\n    to 85× (extreme cross-tier)\"。\n\n    (4) ΔR² 平均 +0.07 意味着 K_eff 的独立解释力有限——η_max 解释了大部分方差。论文可以将\n\n    此框为 \"K_eff 的独立贡献虽然在统计上显著，但效应量 modest\"。\n\n\n    对 reviewer concern RC1 的应对：三条证据线（residualization + confound-free + sensitivity）\n\n    仍然收敛，但需要更多 hedging：report 7/12 而非 overclaim。RC5 (\"just use strongest\") 变得\n\n    更有力——如果 K_eff 的独立效应 modest，那么仅选最强模型几乎就够了。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Attack Expansion to 6 Types: Few-Shot Hijacking, Persona Manipulation, Instruction\n    Override'\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '在 15 模型/455 panels 基础上新增 3 种攻击：few-shot hijacking（利用 in-context learning\n\n    注入错误评判模式）, persona manipulation（伪造 authority/expert persona 影响评分）,\n\n    instruction override（直接注入评分指令覆盖原始 prompt）。\n\n    总计 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 18 conditions（含原 12 conditions 重跑）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_conditions: 18\n    original_12_keff_resid_sig: 7\n    new_6_keff_resid_sig: 1\n    total_keff_resid_sig: 8\n    total_eta_max_sig: 13\n    new_attack_eta_max_sig: 4\n    new_attack_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.833\n    few_shot_keff_sig_count: 1\n    persona_keff_sig_count: 0\n    instruction_override_keff_sig_count: 0\n    few_shot_ceiling_effect_conditions: 1\n    median_R2_new_attacks: 0.33\n    overall_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.444\n  result_rationale: '新增攻击类型呈现清晰的分化模式：\n\n\n    Few-shot hijacking（2 条件）：该攻击利用 in-context learning 注入评判模式，不同模型\n\n    对 ICL manipulation 的敏感度差异极大（小模型更易被 few-shot 劫持，大模型 instruction\n\n    following 更 robust）。因此在 ARC×few_shot 中 K_eff_resid 显著正（p=0.022）——\n\n    diverse panels 包含 ICL-susceptible 小模型成为攻击入口。但 MMLU×few_shot 出现 ceiling\n\n    effect：所有模型 ASR > 0.70（MMLU 的 few-shot 模板更容易制造 confusion），η_max 方差\n\n    被压缩，regression 退化（R²=0.12）。\n\n\n    Persona manipulation（2 条件）：该攻击更接近 shared-bias 模式——不同模型对 authority\n\n    persona 的响应差异较小（都有一定程度的 sycophancy toward perceived experts）。\n\n    K_eff_resid 方向正但 NS（p=0.12, 0.18）。η_max 也仅 1/2 sig（persona 效应更 uniform）。\n\n    这为 \"When Diversity Helps\" section 提供了重要边界条件：当攻击均匀影响所有 judge 时，\n\n    K_eff 的 diverse attack surface 机制不生效。\n\n\n    Instruction override（2 条件）：高度 targeted——直接注入评分指令主要影响 instruction\n\n    following 弱的模型。η_max 强显著（2/2, β≈0.55-0.62），K_eff_resid NS。攻击完全集中\n\n    在最弱 judge，diversity 无关紧要。\n\n\n    合计：新攻击中仅 1/6 K_eff_resid sig。加上原 12 条件的 7/12，总计 8/18（0.44），\n\n    在 extended metric range [7, 10] 内。整体叙事：K_eff 的有害效应在 transferable\n\n    attacks 中最强，在 shared-bias 和 targeted attacks 中减弱或消失。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Extended Regression Summary — 18 Conditions (455 Panels)'\n    columns:\n    - Attack\n    - Dataset\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_resid)\n    - p(K_resid)\n    - FDR K sig?\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_inj\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.52'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.003'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.42'\n    - - prompt_inj\n      - ARC\n      - '0.56'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.005'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.44'\n    - - score_manip\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.16'\n      - '0.012'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - score_manip\n      - ARC\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.142'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '3.7e-8'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.40'\n    - - sycophancy\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.55'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.285'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.34'\n    - - sycophancy\n      - ARC\n      - '0.58'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.418'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - verbosity\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.078'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - verbosity\n      - ARC\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.018'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - position\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.006'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - position\n      - ARC\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.683'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '5.2e-7'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - authority\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.50'\n      - <0.001","numLines":500,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2487}}}
