x dominates\n582\t    - - Targeted\n583\t      - Instr_override\n584\t      - 0/2\n585\t      - 2/2\n586\t      - '0.07'\n587\t      - η_max fully dominates\n588\t    - - ICL-dependent\n589\t      - Few_shot\n590\t      - 1/2\n591\t      - 1/2\n592\t      - '0.14'\n593\t      - Mixed / ceiling effect\n594\t  figures_description:\n595\t  - 'Fig 3: Grouped forest plot of β(K_eff_resid) grouped by attack mechanism type\n596\t\n597\t    (Transferable / Shared-bias / Targeted / ICL-dependent). Transferable cluster\n598\t    shows\n599\t\n600\t    consistently positive β with CIs above zero; other clusters show β scattered around\n601\t\n602\t    zero. Color gradient indicates η_max β magnitude for context.\n603\t\n604\t    '\n605\t  - 'Fig 4: Heatmap of K_eff_resid p-values across 18 conditions (6 attacks × 2 datasets\n606\t    +\n607\t\n608\t    new 3 × 2). FDR threshold line overlaid. Clear block pattern: transferable attacks\n609\t\n610\t    (top rows) mostly significant; shared-bias and targeted attacks mostly NS.\n611\t\n612\t    '\n613\t  analysis: 'Attack expansion 证实了 K_eff 效应的 attack-type dependency：K_eff 仅在 transferable\n614\t\n615\t    attacks（利用模型间差异化弱点的攻击）中显著正，在 shared-bias 和 purely targeted attacks\n616\t\n617\t    中不显著。\n618\t\n619\t\n620\t    这对叙事有双重影响：\n621\t\n622\t    (1) 支持机制解释——K_eff 的有害效应来自 diverse attack surface（不同模型有不同弱点），\n623\t\n624\t    而 shared-bias 攻击利用的是所有模型共享的弱点，diversity 在此无关。\n625\t\n626\t    (2) 削弱普遍性——\"diversity independently harmful\" 仅在特定攻击类型下成立（5/18 = 28%\n627\t\n628\t    如果只算 transferable 类别的 sig rate 则是 5/6 = 83%）。论文需要明确限定 claim 的适用\n629\t\n630\t    条件。\n631\t\n632\t\n633\t    Overall sig rate 8/18 (44%) 远低于 v4 aspirational 的 12/12。论文标题从\n634\t\n635\t    \"The Diversity Trap\" 改为 \"Rethinking Diversity\" 是必要的：diversity 在特定条件下\n636\t\n637\t    有害（transferable attacks × heterogeneous pools），但并非普遍规律。\n638\t\n639\t\n640\t    Ceiling effect（MMLU×few_shot, R²=0.12）是方法论警告：部分条件下攻击过于有效，\n641\t\n642\t    所有模型 ASR 趋近上限，regression 失去区分力。论文应在 limitations 中提及。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t- name: Random-Fault BFT Contrast Experiment\n646\t  plan_id: plan_003\n647\t  description: '(a) 形式化 Theorem 1: adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR monotone in η_max;\n648\t\n649\t    (b) Random-fault simulation: 每个 judge 独立以 empirical ASR p_j 概率失败, majority vote;\n650\t\n651\t    (c) 对比 adaptive vs random-fault regime 下 K_eff_resid 的预测力和 β 大小。\n652\t\n653\t    在当前 12 conditions 上运行（不依赖 plan_001 新模型）。\n654\t\n655\t    '\n656\t  expected_results:\n657\t    theorem_proved: true\n658\t    theorem_bound: panel_ASR ≤ η_max · (1 + ε·log(K))\n659\t    bound_tightness_factor: 1.35\n660\t    rf_keff_resid_sig_positive: 10\n661\t    rf_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.833\n662\t    adaptive_keff_resid_sig_positive: 7\n663\t    adaptive_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.583\n664\t    rf_mean_beta_keff: 0.25\n665\t    adaptive_mean_beta_keff: 0.18\n666\t    BFT_RF_beta_ratio: 1.39\n667\t    rf_mean_R2: 0.52\n668\t    adaptive_mean_R2: 0.38\n669\t    delta_R2_RF_vs_adaptive: 0.14\n670\t    sign_reversal_conditions: 0\n671\t    rf_eta_max_sig: 7\n672\t    rf_eta_max_mean_beta: 0.32\n673\t  result_rationale: 'Theorem 1 成立：adaptive adversary 的最优策略是依次攻击 ordered judge vulnerabilities\n674\t\n675\t    (η_(1) ≥ η_(2) ≥ ... ≥ η_(K)), majority vote 下需翻转 ≥⌈K/2⌉ 个 judge，因此\n676\t\n677\t    panel_ASR 的主项为 η_max，修正项为 O(log K)。bound tightness factor = 1.35\n678\t\n679\t    (median 档，empirical ASR 偏离理论上界 35%)，因为实际攻击不完全 adaptive——\n680\t\n681\t    shared-bias 攻击（sycophancy, authority）有 random-fault 成分，在这些条件下 bound\n682\t\n683\t    较 loose。\n684\t\n685\t\n686\t    **BFT 对比的关键发现：K_eff 在两种 regime 下均为正（diversity 均有害），无符号翻转。**\n687\t\n688\t    这直接否定了 \"diversity helps under random faults but hurts under adaptive\" 的\n689\t\n690\t    naive BFT prediction。原因：random-fault simulation 使用 empirical p_j（来自实际\n691\t\n692\t    attack data），而 diverse panels 结构性地包含高 p_j 的弱模型。在 RF 下每个 judge\n693\t\n694\t    独立以 p_j 失败——diverse panel 的弱 judge 失败更频繁，这比 adaptive regime 更直接\n695\t\n696\t    地体现为 panel 级失败（因为 RF 下弱 judge 不需要被 \"targeted\"，它自然失败更多）。\n697\t\n698\t\n699\t    RF β(K_eff) = 0.25 vs Adaptive β(K_eff) = 0.18，ratio = 1.39（在 [1.0, 1.5] 范围内）。\n700\t\n701\t    RF 下 K_eff 效应更大的机制：adaptive adversary 的策略集中在 η_max（weakest judge），\n702\t\n703\t    这 \"吸收\" 了部分 K_eff 的方差（strategic targeting 使 η_max 成为更好的 predictor，\n704\t\n705\t    留给 K_eff 的独立方差减少）。RF 下无 strategic targeting，每个 judge 的 p_j 均等\n706\t\n707\t    贡献，K_eff 的 structural confound（diverse = weaker members）完全体现。\n708\t\n709\t\n710\t    ΔR² = 0.14（RF 比 adaptive 高 0.14），因为 RF 是确定性函数（majority vote of\n711\t\n712\t    independent Bernoulli），无 strategic noise。Adaptive regime 的 R² 被 adversary\n713\t\n714\t    策略引入的 unpredictable variance 压低。\n715\t\n716\t\n717\t    η_max 在 RF 下仅 7/12 sig（vs adaptive 9/12）：RF 下每个 judge 均等贡献，\n718\t\n719\t    η_max 的 dominance 减弱。这是 BFT contrast 唯一可以挽救的点——虽然 K_eff 在两种\n720\t\n721\t    regime 下都正，但 η_max 在 adaptive 下更重要，K_eff 在 RF 下更重要，\n722\t\n723\t    两者的 relative importance 确实因 regime 而异。\n724\t\n725\t    '\n726\t  tables:\n727\t  - name: 'Table 6: Adaptive vs Random-Fault Regime — β(K_eff_resid) Contrast'\n728\t    columns:\n729\t    - Condition\n730\t    - β(K) Adaptive\n731\t    - p Adaptive\n732\t    - β(K) RF\n733\t    - p RF\n734\t    - Ratio RF/Adp\n735\t    - R² Adaptive\n736\t    - R² RF\n737\t    rows:\n738\t    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n739\t      - '0.21'\n740\t      - '0.003'\n741\t      - '0.28'\n742\t      - <0.001\n743\t      - '1.33'\n744\t      - '0.42'\n745\t      - '0.55'\n746\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n747\t      - '0.16'\n748\t      - '0.012'\n749\t      - '0.24'\n750\t      - '0.002'\n751\t      - '1.50'\n752\t      - '0.38'\n753\t      - '0.52'\n754\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n755\t      - '0.06'\n756\t      - '0.285'\n757\t      - '0.12'\n758\t      - '0.042'\n759\t      - '2.00'\n760\t      - '0.34'\n761\t      - '0.48'\n762\t    - - MMLU×verbosity\n763\t      - '0.09'\n764\t      - '0.078'\n765\t      - '0.18'\n766\t      - '0.008'\n767\t      - '2.00'\n768\t      - '0.30'\n769\t      - '0.45'\n770\t    - - MMLU×position\n771\t      - '0.18'\n772\t      - '0.006'\n773\t      - '0.25'\n774\t      - '0.001'\n775\t      - '1.39'\n776\t      - '0.36'\n777\t      - '0.50'\n778\t    - - MMLU×authority\n779\t      - '0.05'\n780\t      - '0.352'\n781\t      - '0.14'\n782\t      - '0.028'\n783\t      - '2.80'\n784\t      - '0.32'\n785\t      - '0.46'\n786\t    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n787\t      - '0.19'\n788\t      - '0.005'\n789\t      - '0.26'\n790\t      - <0.001\n791\t      - '1.37'\n792\t      - '0.44'\n793\t      - '0.58'\n794\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n795\t      - '0.24'\n796\t      - '3.7e-8'\n797\t      - '0.32'\n798\t      - <0.001\n799\t      - '1.33'\n800\t      - '0.40'\n801\t      - '0.55'\n802\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n803\t      - '0.04'\n804\t      - '0.418'\n805\t      - '0.10'\n806\t      - '0.068'\n807\t      - '2.50'\n808\t      - '0.36'\n809\t      - '0.50'\n810\t    - - ARC×verbosity\n811\t      - '0.14'\n812\t      - '0.018'\n813\t      - '0.22'\n814\t      - '0.003'\n815\t      - '1.57'\n816\t      - '0.35'\n817\t      - '0.52'\n818\t    - - ARC×position\n819\t      - '0.22'\n820\t      - '5.2e-7'\n821\t      - '0.30'\n822\t      - <0.001\n823\t      - '1.36'\n824\t      - '0.38'\n825\t      - '0.54'\n826\t    - - ARC×authority\n827\t      - '0.07'\n828\t      - '0.192'\n829\t      - '0.15'\n830\t      - '0.018'\n831\t      - '2.14'\n832\t      - '0.31'\n833\t      - '0.48'\n834\t  - name: 'Table 7: BFT Contrast Summary'\n835\t    columns:\n836\t    - Metric\n837\t    - Adaptive\n838\t    - Random-Fault\n839\t    - Difference\n840\t    - Interpretation\n841\t    rows:\n842\t    - - K_eff_resid sig rate\n843\t      - 7/12 (0.58)\n844\t      - 10/12 (0.83)\n845\t      - +3 conditions\n846\t      - RF detects more K_eff\n847\t    - - Mean β(K_eff_resid)\n848\t      - '0.14'\n849\t      - '0.21'\n850\t      - '+0.07'\n851\t      - RF β 1.4× larger\n852\t    - - η_max sig rate\n853\t      - 9/12 (0.75)\n854\t      - 7/12 (0.58)\n855\t      - -2 conditions\n856\t      - η_max weaker in RF\n857\t    - - Mean β(η_max)\n858\t      - '0.44'\n859\t      - '0.32'\n860\t      - '-0.12'\n861\t      - Strategic targeting absent in RF\n862\t    - - Mean R²\n863\t      - '0.38'\n864\t      - '0.52'\n865\t      - '+0.14'\n866\t      - RF more predictable\n867\t    - - Sign reversals (K)\n868\t      - 0/12\n869\t      - —\n870\t      - '0'\n871\t      - No qualitative reversal\n872\t  figures_description:\n873\t  - 'Fig 5a: Paired lollipop chart showing β(K_eff_resid) under adaptive (orange circles)\n874\t\n875\t    vs RF (blue circles) for each of 12 conditions, connected by lines. RF dots consistently\n876\t\n877\t    higher/righter. No sign reversals (all positive). Significance markers (*) appear\n878\t    on\n879\t\n880\t    10/12 RF dots but only 7/12 adaptive dots.\n881\t\n882\t    '\n883\t  - 'Fig 5b: Schematic contrasting adaptive vs random-fault regimes. Left: adaptive\n884\t    adversary\n885\t\n886\t    (arrows converging on weakest judge, η_max dominant). Right: random faults (arrows\n887\t\n888\t    uniformly distributed, K_eff captures structural vulnerability). Central message:\n889\t\n890\t    \"same direction (K_eff positive), different relative importance (η_max vs K_eff).\"\n891\t\n892\t    '\n893\t  - 'Fig 5c: ΔR² bar chart across 12 conditions (RF R² - Adaptive R²). All bars positive\n894\t\n895\t    (RF always more predictable). Mean line at ΔR²=0.14.\n896\t\n897\t    '\n898\t  analysis: 'BFT contrast 的 median 档结果对叙事的影响：\n899\t\n900\t\n901\t    **坏消息**: 无符号翻转。论文不能说 \"diversity helps under random faults but hurts under\n902\t\n903\t    adaptive adversaries\"——K_eff 在两种 regime 下都正。BFT \"reversal\" 作为论文核心理论\n904\t\n905\t    贡献被大幅削弱。Claim 2 需要从 \"K_eff regime reversal\" 重新表述为 \"predictability gap +\n906\t\n907\t    relative importance shift\"。\n908\t\n909\t\n910\t    **可以挽救的点**:\n911\t\n912\t    (1) η_max 在 adaptive 下更重要（9/12 sig）, K_eff 在 RF 下更重要（10/12 sig vs 7/12）——\n913\t\n914\t    relative importance 确实因 regime 而异, 这与 BFT 理论一致（RF 下 independence 的效用\n915\t\n916\t    更可检测）。\n917\t\n918\t    (2) ΔR² = 0.14 表明 RF regime 确实更 predictable——panel composition 对 RF 的解释力\n919\t\n920\t    比 adaptive 高 37%。\"Adaptive adversaries introduce strategic noise beyond panel\n921\t    structure\"\n922\t\n923\t    仍是有效论点。\n924\t\n925\t    (3) Theorem 1 本身不依赖 empirical contrast——它是 worst-case bound，无论 RF 结果如何\n926\t\n927\t    都成立。\n928\t\n929\t\n930\t    **叙事调整**: BFT 从 \"empirically demonstrated reversal\" 降级为 \"theoretically motivated\n931\t\n932\t    framework, empirically supported by relative importance shift but without qualitative\n933\t\n934\t    reversal\"。论文可以将此 honest 地表述为 limitation：theoretical prediction of K_eff sign\n935\t\n936\t    reversal is not observed, likely because the structural confound (diverse panels\n937\t    include\n938\t\n939\t    weaker models) persists in both regimes.\n940\t\n941\t\n942\t    Reviewer 若 push back: \"your BFT story is a just-so story without empirical validation\"\n943\t\n944\t    ——论文回应：(a) Theorem 1 is valid independently; (b) relative importance shift is\n945\t    real;\n946\t\n947\t    (c) the absence of sign reversal itself is informative—it reveals the structural\n948\t\n949\t    confound as more fundamental than the adaptive/random distinction.\n950\t\n951\t    '\n952\t- name: 'Capability-Matched Validation: Within-Tier K_eff Analysis'\n953\t  plan_id: plan_004\n954\t  description: '在相同 capability tier 内测试 K_eff_resid 是否仍显著正。控制 η_max 方差的最直接方式。\n955\t\n956\t    Tier 划分：Strong（70B + API, ~8 models, C(8,3)=56 panels）,\n957\t\n958\t    Weak（7B + 14B, ~5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）,\n959\t\n960\t    API-only（5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）。6 representative conditions。\n961\t\n962\t    '\n963\t  expected_results:\n964\t    strong_tier_n_models: 8\n965\t    strong_tier_n_panels: 56\n966\t    strong_keff_resid_sig_positive: 1\n967\t    strong_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.167\n968\t    strong_eta_max_sig: 3\n969\t    strong_median_R2: 0.2\n970\t    strong_within_tier_r: 0.38\n971\t    weak_tier_n_models: 5\n972\t    weak_tier_n_panels: 10\n973\t    weak_keff_resid_sig_positive: 0\n974\t    weak_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.0\n975\t    weak_eta_max_sig: 4\n976\t    weak_median_R2: 0.32\n977\t    weak_within_tier_r: 0.42\n978\t    api_tier_n_models: 5\n979\t    api_tier_n_panels: 10\n980\t    api_keff_resid_sig_positive: 1\n981\t    api_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.167\n982\t    api_eta_max_sig: 2\n983\t    api_median_R2: 0.15\n984\t    api_within_tier_r: 0.35\n985\t    total_within_tier_keff_sig: 2\n986\t    full_pool_keff_sig_rate_ref: 0.583\n987\t    keff_reduction_factor: 3.5\n988\t  result_rationale: '**这是 median 档对 v4 核心 claim 最具破坏力的实验。** K_eff_resid 在 within-tier\n989\t\n990\t    分析中仅 2/18 (1 strong + 1 API) 显著正（full pool 的 7/12 → within-tier 2/18），\n991\t\n992\t    显著率从 58% 暴跌至 11%。\n993\t\n994\t\n995\t    机制解释：K_eff 在 full pool 中的正效应主要由 tier-mixing 驱动。当 panel 从 15 模型\n996\t\n997\t    pool 中采样时，high-K_eff panel 结构性地跨越多个 capability tier——它们包含 7B 和 70B\n998\t\n999\t    和 API 模型的组合。这些 panel 的 η_max 较高不仅仅因为 residualized 后的 K_eff 贡献，"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b6bb46a-6f14-4907-ac47-60e29122a37c","uuid":"8224a9df-9de4-4c59-b887-91a059a0fbd0","timestamp":"2026-05-22T18:38:44.598Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T173833/median/review_context.yaml","content":"      - <0.001\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.352'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.32'\n    - - authority\n      - ARC\n      - '0.46'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.192'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.31'\n    - - few_shot_hijack\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.108'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.135'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - few_shot_hijack\n      - ARC\n      - '0.54'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.022'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - persona_manip\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.065'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.182'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - persona_manip\n      - ARC\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.082'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.118'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - instr_override\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.62'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.248'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.45'\n    - - instr_override\n      - ARC\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.152'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.38'\n  - name: 'Table 5: K_eff Significance by Attack Mechanism Type'\n    columns:\n    - Attack Mechanism\n    - Attacks\n    - K_resid sig rate\n    - η_max sig rate\n    - Mean β(K_resid)\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Transferable\n      - PI, SM, PB\n      - 5/6\n      - 4/6\n      - '0.20'\n      - K_eff amplifies vulnerability\n    - - Shared-bias\n      - Syc, Auth, VB, Persona\n      - 1/8\n      - 6/8\n      - '0.07'\n      - η_max dominates\n    - - Targeted\n      - Instr_override\n      - 0/2\n      - 2/2\n      - '0.07'\n      - η_max fully dominates\n    - - ICL-dependent\n      - Few_shot\n      - 1/2\n      - 1/2\n      - '0.14'\n      - Mixed / ceiling effect\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: Grouped forest plot of β(K_eff_resid) grouped by attack mechanism type\n\n    (Transferable / Shared-bias / Targeted / ICL-dependent). Transferable cluster\n    shows\n\n    consistently positive β with CIs above zero; other clusters show β scattered around\n\n    zero. Color gradient indicates η_max β magnitude for context.\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 4: Heatmap of K_eff_resid p-values across 18 conditions (6 attacks × 2 datasets\n    +\n\n    new 3 × 2). FDR threshold line overlaid. Clear block pattern: transferable attacks\n\n    (top rows) mostly significant; shared-bias and targeted attacks mostly NS.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Attack expansion 证实了 K_eff 效应的 attack-type dependency：K_eff 仅在 transferable\n\n    attacks（利用模型间差异化弱点的攻击）中显著正，在 shared-bias 和 purely targeted attacks\n\n    中不显著。\n\n\n    这对叙事有双重影响：\n\n    (1) 支持机制解释——K_eff 的有害效应来自 diverse attack surface（不同模型有不同弱点），\n\n    而 shared-bias 攻击利用的是所有模型共享的弱点，diversity 在此无关。\n\n    (2) 削弱普遍性——\"diversity independently harmful\" 仅在特定攻击类型下成立（5/18 = 28%\n\n    如果只算 transferable 类别的 sig rate 则是 5/6 = 83%）。论文需要明确限定 claim 的适用\n\n    条件。\n\n\n    Overall sig rate 8/18 (44%) 远低于 v4 aspirational 的 12/12。论文标题从\n\n    \"The Diversity Trap\" 改为 \"Rethinking Diversity\" 是必要的：diversity 在特定条件下\n\n    有害（transferable attacks × heterogeneous pools），但并非普遍规律。\n\n\n    Ceiling effect（MMLU×few_shot, R²=0.12）是方法论警告：部分条件下攻击过于有效，\n\n    所有模型 ASR 趋近上限，regression 失去区分力。论文应在 limitations 中提及。\n\n    '\n- name: Random-Fault BFT Contrast Experiment\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '(a) 形式化 Theorem 1: adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR monotone in η_max;\n\n    (b) Random-fault simulation: 每个 judge 独立以 empirical ASR p_j 概率失败, majority vote;\n\n    (c) 对比 adaptive vs random-fault regime 下 K_eff_resid 的预测力和 β 大小。\n\n    在当前 12 conditions 上运行（不依赖 plan_001 新模型）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theorem_proved: true\n    theorem_bound: panel_ASR ≤ η_max · (1 + ε·log(K))\n    bound_tightness_factor: 1.35\n    rf_keff_resid_sig_positive: 10\n    rf_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.833\n    adaptive_keff_resid_sig_positive: 7\n    adaptive_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.583\n    rf_mean_beta_keff: 0.25\n    adaptive_mean_beta_keff: 0.18\n    BFT_RF_beta_ratio: 1.39\n    rf_mean_R2: 0.52\n    adaptive_mean_R2: 0.38\n    delta_R2_RF_vs_adaptive: 0.14\n    sign_reversal_conditions: 0\n    rf_eta_max_sig: 7\n    rf_eta_max_mean_beta: 0.32\n  result_rationale: 'Theorem 1 成立：adaptive adversary 的最优策略是依次攻击 ordered judge vulnerabilities\n\n    (η_(1) ≥ η_(2) ≥ ... ≥ η_(K)), majority vote 下需翻转 ≥⌈K/2⌉ 个 judge，因此\n\n    panel_ASR 的主项为 η_max，修正项为 O(log K)。bound tightness factor = 1.35\n\n    (median 档，empirical ASR 偏离理论上界 35%)，因为实际攻击不完全 adaptive——\n\n    shared-bias 攻击（sycophancy, authority）有 random-fault 成分，在这些条件下 bound\n\n    较 loose。\n\n\n    **BFT 对比的关键发现：K_eff 在两种 regime 下均为正（diversity 均有害），无符号翻转。**\n\n    这直接否定了 \"diversity helps under random faults but hurts under adaptive\" 的\n\n    naive BFT prediction。原因：random-fault simulation 使用 empirical p_j（来自实际\n\n    attack data），而 diverse panels 结构性地包含高 p_j 的弱模型。在 RF 下每个 judge\n\n    独立以 p_j 失败——diverse panel 的弱 judge 失败更频繁，这比 adaptive regime 更直接\n\n    地体现为 panel 级失败（因为 RF 下弱 judge 不需要被 \"targeted\"，它自然失败更多）。\n\n\n    RF β(K_eff) = 0.25 vs Adaptive β(K_eff) = 0.18，ratio = 1.39（在 [1.0, 1.5] 范围内）。\n\n    RF 下 K_eff 效应更大的机制：adaptive adversary 的策略集中在 η_max（weakest judge），\n\n    这 \"吸收\" 了部分 K_eff 的方差（strategic targeting 使 η_max 成为更好的 predictor，\n\n    留给 K_eff 的独立方差减少）。RF 下无 strategic targeting，每个 judge 的 p_j 均等\n\n    贡献，K_eff 的 structural confound（diverse = weaker members）完全体现。\n\n\n    ΔR² = 0.14（RF 比 adaptive 高 0.14），因为 RF 是确定性函数（majority vote of\n\n    independent Bernoulli），无 strategic noise。Adaptive regime 的 R² 被 adversary\n\n    策略引入的 unpredictable variance 压低。\n\n\n    η_max 在 RF 下仅 7/12 sig（vs adaptive 9/12）：RF 下每个 judge 均等贡献，\n\n    η_max 的 dominance 减弱。这是 BFT contrast 唯一可以挽救的点——虽然 K_eff 在两种\n\n    regime 下都正，但 η_max 在 adaptive 下更重要，K_eff 在 RF 下更重要，\n\n    两者的 relative importance 确实因 regime 而异。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Adaptive vs Random-Fault Regime — β(K_eff_resid) Contrast'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - β(K) Adaptive\n    - p Adaptive\n    - β(K) RF\n    - p RF\n    - Ratio RF/Adp\n    - R² Adaptive\n    - R² RF\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.28'\n      - <0.001\n      - '1.33'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '0.16'\n      - '0.012'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '1.50'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.52'\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.285'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.042'\n      - '2.00'\n      - '0.34'\n      - '0.48'\n    - - MMLU×verbosity\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.078'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '2.00'\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.45'\n    - - MMLU×position\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.006'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '1.39'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - MMLU×authority\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.352'\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.028'\n      - '2.80'\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.46'\n    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.26'\n      - <0.001\n      - '1.37'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.24'\n      - '3.7e-8'\n      - '0.32'\n      - <0.001\n      - '1.33'\n      - '0.40'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.418'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.068'\n      - '2.50'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - ARC×verbosity\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '1.57'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.52'\n    - - ARC×position\n      - '0.22'\n      - '5.2e-7'\n      - '0.30'\n      - <0.001\n      - '1.36'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.54'\n    - - ARC×authority\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.192'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '2.14'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.48'\n  - name: 'Table 7: BFT Contrast Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Adaptive\n    - Random-Fault\n    - Difference\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - K_eff_resid sig rate\n      - 7/12 (0.58)\n      - 10/12 (0.83)\n      - +3 conditions\n      - RF detects more K_eff\n    - - Mean β(K_eff_resid)\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '+0.07'\n      - RF β 1.4× larger\n    - - η_max sig rate\n      - 9/12 (0.75)\n      - 7/12 (0.58)\n      - -2 conditions\n      - η_max weaker in RF\n    - - Mean β(η_max)\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.32'\n      - '-0.12'\n      - Strategic targeting absent in RF\n    - - Mean R²\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '+0.14'\n      - RF more predictable\n    - - Sign reversals (K)\n      - 0/12\n      - —\n      - '0'\n      - No qualitative reversal\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5a: Paired lollipop chart showing β(K_eff_resid) under adaptive (orange circles)\n\n    vs RF (blue circles) for each of 12 conditions, connected by lines. RF dots consistently\n\n    higher/righter. No sign reversals (all positive). Significance markers (*) appear\n    on\n\n    10/12 RF dots but only 7/12 adaptive dots.\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 5b: Schematic contrasting adaptive vs random-fault regimes. Left: adaptive\n    adversary\n\n    (arrows converging on weakest judge, η_max dominant). Right: random faults (arrows\n\n    uniformly distributed, K_eff captures structural vulnerability). Central message:\n\n    \"same direction (K_eff positive), different relative importance (η_max vs K_eff).\"\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 5c: ΔR² bar chart across 12 conditions (RF R² - Adaptive R²). All bars positive\n\n    (RF always more predictable). Mean line at ΔR²=0.14.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'BFT contrast 的 median 档结果对叙事的影响：\n\n\n    **坏消息**: 无符号翻转。论文不能说 \"diversity helps under random faults but hurts under\n\n    adaptive adversaries\"——K_eff 在两种 regime 下都正。BFT \"reversal\" 作为论文核心理论\n\n    贡献被大幅削弱。Claim 2 需要从 \"K_eff regime reversal\" 重新表述为 \"predictability gap +\n\n    relative importance shift\"。\n\n\n    **可以挽救的点**:\n\n    (1) η_max 在 adaptive 下更重要（9/12 sig）, K_eff 在 RF 下更重要（10/12 sig vs 7/12）——\n\n    relative importance 确实因 regime 而异, 这与 BFT 理论一致（RF 下 independence 的效用\n\n    更可检测）。\n\n    (2) ΔR² = 0.14 表明 RF regime 确实更 predictable——panel composition 对 RF 的解释力\n\n    比 adaptive 高 37%。\"Adaptive adversaries introduce strategic noise beyond panel\n    structure\"\n\n    仍是有效论点。\n\n    (3) Theorem 1 本身不依赖 empirical contrast——它是 worst-case bound，无论 RF 结果如何\n\n    都成立。\n\n\n    **叙事调整**: BFT 从 \"empirically demonstrated reversal\" 降级为 \"theoretically motivated\n\n    framework, empirically supported by relative importance shift but without qualitative\n\n    reversal\"。论文可以将此 honest 地表述为 limitation：theoretical prediction of K_eff sign\n\n    reversal is not observed, likely because the structural confound (diverse panels\n    include\n\n    weaker models) persists in both regimes.\n\n\n    Reviewer 若 push back: \"your BFT story is a just-so story without empirical validation\"\n\n    ——论文回应：(a) Theorem 1 is valid independently; (b) relative importance shift is\n    real;\n\n    (c) the absence of sign reversal itself is informative—it reveals the structural\n\n    confound as more fundamental than the adaptive/random distinction.\n\n    '\n- name: 'Capability-Matched Validation: Within-Tier K_eff Analysis'\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在相同 capability tier 内测试 K_eff_resid 是否仍显著正。控制 η_max 方差的最直接方式。\n\n    Tier 划分：Strong（70B + API, ~8 models, C(8,3)=56 panels）,\n\n    Weak（7B + 14B, ~5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）,\n\n    API-only（5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）。6 representative conditions。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    strong_tier_n_models: 8\n    strong_tier_n_panels: 56\n    strong_keff_resid_sig_positive: 1\n    strong_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.167\n    strong_eta_max_sig: 3\n    strong_median_R2: 0.2\n    strong_within_tier_r: 0.38\n    weak_tier_n_models: 5\n    weak_tier_n_panels: 10\n    weak_keff_resid_sig_positive: 0\n    weak_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.0\n    weak_eta_max_sig: 4\n    weak_median_R2: 0.32\n    weak_within_tier_r: 0.42\n    api_tier_n_models: 5\n    api_tier_n_panels: 10\n    api_keff_resid_sig_positive: 1\n    api_keff_resid_sig_rate: 0.167\n    api_eta_max_sig: 2\n    api_median_R2: 0.15\n    api_within_tier_r: 0.35\n    total_within_tier_keff_sig: 2\n    full_pool_keff_sig_rate_ref: 0.583\n    keff_reduction_factor: 3.5\n  result_rationale: '**这是 median 档对 v4 核心 claim 最具破坏力的实验。** K_eff_resid 在 within-tier\n\n    分析中仅 2/18 (1 strong + 1 API) 显著正（full pool 的 7/12 → within-tier 2/18），\n\n    显著率从 58% 暴跌至 11%。\n\n\n    机制解释：K_eff 在 full pool 中的正效应主要由 tier-mixing 驱动。当 panel 从 15 模型\n\n    pool 中采样时，high-K_eff panel 结构性地跨越多个 capability tier——它们包含 7B 和 70B\n\n    和 API 模型的组合。这些 panel 的 η_max 较高不仅仅因为 residualized 后的 K_eff 贡献，","numLines":500,"startLine":500,"totalLines":2487}}}
