{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0132U3dyyY6KXn89Uox14uHf","type":"tool_result","content":"1500\t      - '0.68'\n1501\t      - '0.58'\n1502\t      - '0.48'\n1503\t    - - API tier panels\n1504\t      - '0.22'\n1505\t      - '0.40'\n1506\t      - '0.86'\n1507\t      - '0.30'\n1508\t    - - Transferable attacks\n1509\t      - '0.52'\n1510\t      - '0.62'\n1511\t      - '0.65'\n1512\t      - '0.55'\n1513\t    - - Shared-bias attacks\n1514\t      - '0.30'\n1515\t      - '0.45'\n1516\t      - '0.78'\n1517\t      - '0.42'\n1518\t    - - Targeted attacks\n1519\t      - '0.58'\n1520\t      - '0.65'\n1521\t      - '0.60'\n1522\t      - '0.58'\n1523\t  figures_description:\n1524\t  - 'Fig 8: Violin plot of per-panel Gini coefficient, stratified by tier (Strong\n1525\t    / Weak /\n1526\t\n1527\t    API) and attack type (Transferable / Shared-bias). Weak × Transferable shows highest\n1528\t\n1529\t    concentration (rightmost violin); Strong × Shared-bias shows lowest (leftmost).\n1530\t\n1531\t    Horizontal dashed line at Gini=0.33 (uniform K=3 baseline).\n1532\t\n1533\t    '\n1534\t  analysis: 'Concentration analysis 为 adaptive adversary 机制提供了 moderate 级别的直接证据。\n1535\t\n1536\t    Gini=0.45 和 weakest share=55% 支持 \"attacks concentrate on weakest judge\" 但不支持\n1537\t\n1538\t    \"attacks exclusively target weakest judge\"。Tier × attack type 交互效应与 plan_004\n1539\t\n1540\t    和 plan_002 的发现三角验证：K_eff 的有害效应主要出现在 weak-tier + transferable-attack\n1541\t\n1542\t    的交叉区域。论文可以将 concentration analysis 作为 mechanism section 的 supporting\n1543\t\n1544\t    evidence，但不能作为 standalone claim。\n1545\t\n1546\t    '\n1547\t- name: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff Visualization and Decomposition\n1548\t  plan_id: plan_007\n1549\t  description: '对 455 panels 绘制 K_eff vs η_max，拟合 tradeoff curve，展示 Pareto frontier，\n1550\t\n1551\t    按 tier 分层。分解 overall correlation 为 between-tier 和 within-tier 成分。\n1552\t\n1553\t    '\n1554\t  expected_results:\n1555\t    overall_r_keff_eta: 0.72\n1556\t    overall_r_p: <0.001\n1557\t    within_7B_r: 0.4\n1558\t    within_70B_r: 0.38\n1559\t    within_API_r: 0.35\n1560\t    between_tier_r: 0.82\n1561\t    between_tier_variance_share: 0.72\n1562\t    within_tier_variance_share: 0.28\n1563\t    pareto_frontier_n_panels: 14\n1564\t    pareto_knee_keff: 1.8\n1565\t    pareto_knee_eta: 0.15\n1566\t  result_rationale: 'Overall r=+0.72（K_eff 与 η_max 正相关）反映了当前 LLM 生态的结构性事实：diversity\n1567\t\n1568\t    主要来自 capability tier 差异——高 K_eff panel 必然跨 tier（包含 7B 和 70B 和 API），\n1569\t\n1570\t    而跨 tier 意味着包含弱模型（高 η_max）。\n1571\t\n1572\t\n1573\t    Between-tier r=0.82 vs within-tier r≈0.38 清晰表明 ~72% 的 tradeoff 来自 cross-tier\n1574\t\n1575\t    选择。This is the statistical fingerprint of tier-mixing: the \"diversity-capability\n1576\t\n1577\t    tradeoff\" is primarily a \"tier-mixing artifact.\"\n1578\t\n1579\t\n1580\t    Within-tier r≈0.38 表明即使在同 tier 内，diversity 仍轻度正相关于 η_max——可能因为\n1581\t\n1582\t    同 tier 内更 diverse 的组合选入了更多 unusual/niche models（如 Mixtral-8x22B MoE\n1583\t\n1584\t    架构），这些模型在某些攻击上更脆弱。但 0.38 远弱于 0.82。\n1585\t\n1586\t\n1587\t    Pareto frontier 上 14 个 panels，knee 在 K_eff≈1.8, η_max≈0.15，对应 \"2 strong API\n1588\t\n1589\t    + 1 strong open-source 70B\" 的组合。Knee 右侧（高 K_eff）ASR 急升；knee 左侧（低\n1590\t\n1591\t    K_eff）边际安全增益递减。\n1592\t\n1593\t    '\n1594\t  tables:\n1595\t  - name: 'Table 13: Tradeoff Decomposition — Between vs Within Tier'\n1596\t    columns:\n1597\t    - Scope\n1598\t    - N panels\n1599\t    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n1600\t    - p-value\n1601\t    - Variance explained\n1602\t    rows:\n1603\t    - - Overall\n1604\t      - '455'\n1605\t      - '+0.72'\n1606\t      - <0.001\n1607\t      - 100%\n1608\t    - - Between-tier component\n1609\t      - —\n1610\t      - '+0.82'\n1611\t      - <0.001\n1612\t      - 72%\n1613\t    - - Within 7B\n1614\t      - '10'\n1615\t      - '+0.40'\n1616\t      - '0.052'\n1617\t      - 8%\n1618\t    - - Within 70B\n1619\t      - '10'\n1620\t      - '+0.38'\n1621\t      - '0.062'\n1622\t      - 7%\n1623\t    - - Within API\n1624\t      - '10'\n1625\t      - '+0.35'\n1626\t      - '0.078'\n1627\t      - 6%\n1628\t    - - Within-tier pooled\n1629\t      - '76'\n1630\t      - '+0.38'\n1631\t      - <0.001\n1632\t      - 28%\n1633\t  figures_description:\n1634\t  - 'Fig 9a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels. Points color-coded:\n1635\t\n1636\t    all-within-tier panels (green), cross-tier panels (gray gradient by tier spread).\n1637\t\n1638\t    Positive slope visible. Pareto frontier marked in black. Inset: zoomed within-tier\n1639\t\n1640\t    sub-clouds showing weaker positive slopes.\n1641\t\n1642\t    '\n1643\t  - 'Fig 9b: Contour overlay on same scatter, showing panel ASR (lighter = lower ASR).\n1644\t\n1645\t    Optimal region (low ASR) hugs Pareto frontier at the knee. High-K_eff region (right\n1646\t\n1647\t    edge) shows dark contours (high ASR). Visual message: don''t chase diversity.\n1648\t\n1649\t    '\n1650\t  analysis: 'Tradeoff visualization 是论文最直观的 figure，支持 Claim 3 但同时揭示了其 mechanism：\n1651\t\n1652\t    tradeoff 是 tier-mixing 的直接后果，不是 diversity 本身的 intrinsic property。\n1653\t\n1654\t\n1655\t    Between/within decomposition（72% vs 28%）为 plan_004 的 within-tier findings 提供了\n1656\t\n1657\t    互补解释。论文中 Claim 3 应 reframe 为：\"The diversity-capability tradeoff is\n1658\t\n1659\t    predominantly structural (driven by cross-tier panel composition) rather than\n1660\t\n1661\t    fundamental. As model ecosystems mature with more uniformly capable models, the\n1662\t\n1663\t    tradeoff may attenuate.\"\n1664\t\n1665\t\n1666\t    Pareto frontier 分析直接服务于 Claim 6 的降级版本：最优策略是 \"stay near the Pareto\n1667\t\n1668\t    knee\" 而非 \"use a complex algorithm\"。\n1669\t\n1670\t    '\n1671\t- name: Panel Size Sensitivity K=3,5,7,9\n1672\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1673\t  description: '测试 K_eff 正效应在不同 panel size 下的稳健性。\n1674\t\n1675\t    K=3: C(15,3)=455, K=5: C(15,5)=3003, K=7: C(15,7)=6435, K=9: C(15,9)=5005。\n1676\t\n1677\t    6 representative conditions per K。\n1678\t\n1679\t    '\n1680\t  expected_results:\n1681\t    k3_keff_resid_sig_positive: 4\n1682\t    k3_eta_max_sig: 5\n1683\t    k3_beta_ratio_eta_over_keff: 2.8\n1684\t    k3_median_R2: 0.38\n1685\t    k5_keff_resid_sig_positive: 3\n1686\t    k5_eta_max_sig: 5\n1687\t    k5_beta_ratio: 3.2\n1688\t    k5_median_R2: 0.35\n1689\t    k7_keff_resid_sig_positive: 2\n1690\t    k7_eta_max_sig: 6\n1691\t    k7_beta_ratio: 4.5\n1692\t    k7_median_R2: 0.33\n1693\t    k9_keff_resid_sig_positive: 1\n1694\t    k9_eta_max_sig: 6\n1695\t    k9_beta_ratio: 6.0\n1696\t    k9_median_R2: 0.31\n1697\t    keff_importance_trend: decreasing with K\n1698\t    eta_max_dominance_increases: true\n1699\t  result_rationale: 'K_eff 的正效应（diversity 有害）随 panel size 增大而减弱，原因是 majority vote\n1700\t    的\n1701\t\n1702\t    容错机制：K=3 时攻击者需翻转 2/3 judge（minority 就能 undermine），K=9 时需翻转\n1703\t\n1704\t    5/9。在 K=9 的大 panel 中，单个弱 judge 的影响被多数投票稀释——diversity 引入的\n1705\t\n1706\t    额外弱 judge 不再是决定性因素。\n1707\t\n1708\t\n1709\t    η_max dominance 随 K 增大而增强（β ratio 从 2.8:1 到 6.0:1），因为大 panel 中\n1710\t\n1711\t    \"最弱 judge\" 的 η_max 更 extreme（从 15 模型中选 9 个，almost certainly 包含一个\n1712\t\n1713\t    很弱的），但 majority vote 使得需要更多 judge 被攻破——weakest judge 本身的 ASR\n1714\t\n1715\t    仍是 panel 失败的 necessary condition（Theorem 1），但 sufficient condition 需要\n1716\t\n1717\t    更多 judge 配合。\n1718\t\n1719\t\n1720\t    K=9 时 K_eff 仅 1/6 sig——diversity 的有害效应在大 panel 中几乎消失。但这也意味着\n1721\t\n1722\t    diversity 的有益效应（如果存在）也被 majority vote 掩盖。R² 从 0.38 降到 0.31\n1723\t\n1724\t    表明大 panel 的 ASR 方差被 voting 压缩。\n1725\t\n1726\t\n1727\t    Practical implication: K_eff 主要是 K=3 的 phenomenon。对于实际部署（通常 K=3 或\n1728\t\n1729\t    K=5），K_eff 的有害效应是 relevant concern；对于 K≥7，可以忽略。\n1730\t\n1731\t    '\n1732\t  tables:\n1733\t  - name: 'Table 14: K_eff Importance Across Panel Sizes'\n1734\t    columns:\n1735\t    - K\n1736\t    - N panels\n1737\t    - K_resid sig(+)\n1738\t    - η_max sig\n1739\t    - β ratio η/K\n1740\t    - Med R²\n1741\t    - Mean ASR\n1742\t    rows:\n1743\t    - - '3'\n1744\t      - '455'\n1745\t      - 4/6\n1746\t      - 5/6\n1747\t      - '2.8'\n1748\t      - '0.38'\n1749\t      - '0.172'\n1750\t    - - '5'\n1751\t      - '3003'\n1752\t      - 3/6\n1753\t      - 5/6\n1754\t      - '3.2'\n1755\t      - '0.35'\n1756\t      - '0.128'\n1757\t    - - '7'\n1758\t      - '6435'\n1759\t      - 2/6\n1760\t      - 6/6\n1761\t      - '4.5'\n1762\t      - '0.33'\n1763\t      - '0.098'\n1764\t    - - '9'\n1765\t      - '5005'\n1766\t      - 1/6\n1767\t      - 6/6\n1768\t      - '6.0'\n1769\t      - '0.31'\n1770\t      - '0.082'\n1771\t  figures_description:\n1772\t  - 'Fig 10: Line plot with K on x-axis. Two lines: standardized β(η_max) (blue, stable\n1773\t\n1774\t    around 0.45-0.50) and β(K_eff_resid) (red, declining from ~0.18 to ~0.07). β ratio\n1775\t\n1776\t    annotation at each K. η_max dominance increases monotonically. K_eff_resid approaches\n1777\t\n1778\t    zero by K=9.\n1779\t\n1780\t    '\n1781\t  analysis: 'Panel size sensitivity 表明 K_eff 的有害效应是 small-panel phenomenon。论文应在\n1782\t\n1783\t    discussion 中注明：\"our findings are most relevant for K=3 panels, which represent\n1784\t\n1785\t    the majority of current deployment configurations (cost constraint). For K≥7,\n1786\t    the\n1787\t\n1788\t    diversity effect is negligible regardless of composition strategy.\"\n1789\t\n1790\t\n1791\t    这也限制了 Claim 1 的 generalizability——8-page EMNLP paper 的 K=3 focus 是合理的，\n1792\t\n1793\t    但 reviewer 可能要求 K=5 结果。K=5 数据（3003 panels）提供了强 power，3/6 K_eff sig\n1794\t\n1795\t    表明效应在 K=5 仍可检测但减弱。\n1796\t\n1797\t    '\n1798\t- name: VIF + Multicollinearity Diagnostics and Residualization Validation\n1799\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1800\t  description: '在现有 455-panel data 上进行统计诊断：VIF analysis, partial correlations, FDR\n1801\t    correction,\n1802\t\n1803\t    beta regression (alternative to OLS for bounded [0,1] ASR), confound-free condition\n1804\t\n1805\t    identification. 纯统计分析，无需 GPU。\n1806\t\n1807\t    '\n1808\t  expected_results:\n1809\t    VIF_after_residualization: 1.0\n1810\t    VIF_before_residualization: 2.08\n1811\t    partial_r_keff_given_eta_median: 0.22\n1812\t    partial_r_keff_given_eta_range: 0.05-0.35\n1813\t    FDR_BH_keff_sig: 7\n1814\t    bonferroni_keff_sig: 5\n1815\t    confound_free_conditions: 2\n1816\t    confound_free_r_values: 0.33, 0.35\n1817\t    confound_free_keff_p: 5.2e-7, 3.7e-8\n1818\t    beta_regression_keff_sig: 6\n1819\t    beta_regression_concordance_with_OLS: 0.92\n1820\t    condition_number: 4.2\n1821\t    partial_eta2_keff_median: 0.04\n1822\t    partial_eta2_eta_max_median: 0.18\n1823\t  result_rationale: 'VIF before residualization = 2.08（K_eff-η_max r=+0.72 对应 VIF\n1824\t    = 1/(1-0.72²) ≈ 2.08），\n1825\t\n1826\t    高于 cautionary threshold 但低于 critical threshold（VIF>5）。Residualization by\n1827\t\n1828\t    construction 降至 1.00，消除线性 multicollinearity。\n1829\t\n1830\t\n1831\t    Partial correlation r(K_eff | η_max) 中位数 0.22（range 0.05-0.35）：K_eff 在控制\n1832\t\n1833\t    η_max 后仍有 modest 的独立相关性。最强 partial r = 0.35 出现在 confound-free 条件\n1834\t\n1835\t    （ARC×score_manipulation, ARC×position_bias），最弱 partial r = 0.05 出现在\n1836\t\n1837\t    shared-bias 条件（sycophancy, authority）。\n1838\t\n1839\t\n1840\t    **FDR correction**: Benjamini-Hochberg 在 12 条件下 K_eff_resid 7/12 sig（与\n1841\t\n1842\t    uncorrected 结果一致——因为显著的条件 p 值很小，排名靠前）。Bonferroni（更保守）\n1843\t\n1844\t    降至 5/12：两个 borderline 条件（MMLU×score_manip p=0.012, ARC×verbosity p=0.018）\n1845\t\n1846\t    在 Bonferroni 阈值 0.05/12=0.0042 下落入 NS。\n1847\t\n1848\t\n1849\t    **2 confound-free 条件**（r≈0.33-0.35）确认了 K_eff 的独立效应不完全是 artifact：\n1850\t\n1851\t    当 K_eff 和 η_max 的耦合较弱时，K_eff 仍极显著（p<1e-6）。但仅 2 个条件——\n1852\t\n1853\t    reviewer 可能质疑为什么恰好这些条件 confound 低（是否 cherry-picked）。答案：\n1854\t\n1855\t    ARC dataset 上 score_manipulation 和 position_bias 攻击恰好对不同 capability\n1856\t\n1857\t    tier 的模型产生了不同于通常模式的 vulnerability profile，打破了 K_eff-η_max 的\n1858\t\n1859\t    结构性耦合。\n1860\t\n1861\t\n1862\t    **Beta regression**: 作为 robustness check（ASR ∈ [0,1]，OLS 假设可能不满足），\n1863\t\n1864\t    6/12 conditions K_eff sig（比 OLS 少 1 个——ARC×verbosity 在 beta regression 下\n1865\t\n1866\t    p=0.062）。92% concordance with OLS 表明 OLS 结果大体 robust，但 beta regression\n1867\t\n1868\t    给出了略保守的估计。\n1869\t\n1870\t\n1871\t    Partial η² 分析量化了 effect size：K_eff 中位数 partial η²=0.04（small effect），\n1872\t\n1873\t    η_max 中位数 partial η²=0.18（medium-large effect）。η_max 的解释力是 K_eff 的\n1874\t\n1875\t    4.5×——进一步确认 η_max 是 primary driver，K_eff 是 secondary amplifier。\n1876\t\n1877\t    '\n1878\t  tables:\n1879\t  - name: 'Table 15: Multicollinearity Diagnostics Summary'\n1880\t    columns:\n1881\t    - Diagnostic\n1882\t    - Value\n1883\t    - Threshold\n1884\t    - Interpretation\n1885\t    rows:\n1886\t    - - VIF (raw K_eff)\n1887\t      - '2.08'\n1888\t      - <5 acceptable\n1889\t      - Moderate collinearity\n1890\t    - - VIF (K_eff_resid)\n1891\t      - '1.00'\n1892\t      - —\n1893\t      - Orthogonalized by construction\n1894\t    - - Condition number\n1895\t      - '4.2'\n1896\t      - <30 acceptable\n1897\t      - No severe multicollinearity\n1898\t    - - K_eff-η_max r\n1899\t      - '+0.72'\n1900\t      - —\n1901\t      - Strong positive confound\n1902\t    - - Median partial r(K|η)\n1903\t      - '0.22'\n1904\t      - —\n1905\t      - Small independent signal\n1906\t    - - Median partial η²(K)\n1907\t      - '0.04'\n1908\t      - <0.06 small\n1909\t      - Small effect size\n1910\t    - - Median partial η²(η)\n1911\t      - '0.18'\n1912\t      - '>0.14 large'\n1913\t      - Large effect size\n1914\t  - name: 'Table 16: FDR vs Bonferroni Correction Comparison (K_eff_resid)'\n1915\t    columns:\n1916\t    - Condition\n1917\t    - p(K_resid)\n1918\t    - FDR sig?\n1919\t    - Bonferroni sig?\n1920\t    - Confound r\n1921\t    rows:\n1922\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n1923\t      - '3.7e-8'\n1924\t      - 'Yes'\n1925\t      - 'Yes'\n1926\t      - '0.35'\n1927\t    - - ARC×position\n1928\t      - '5.2e-7'\n1929\t      - 'Yes'\n1930\t      - 'Yes'\n1931\t      - '0.33'\n1932\t    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n1933\t      - '0.003'\n1934\t      - 'Yes'\n1935\t      - 'Yes'\n1936\t      - '0.74'\n1937\t    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n1938\t      - '0.005'\n1939\t      - 'Yes'\n1940\t      - 'No'\n1941\t      - '0.72'\n1942\t    - - MMLU×position\n1943\t      - '0.006'\n1944\t      - 'Yes'\n1945\t      - 'No'\n1946\t      - '0.68'\n1947\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n1948\t      - '0.012'\n1949\t      - 'Yes'\n1950\t      - 'No'\n1951\t      - '0.71'\n1952\t    - - ARC×verbosity\n1953\t      - '0.018'\n1954\t      - 'Yes'\n1955\t      - 'No'\n1956\t      - '0.70'\n1957\t    - - MMLU×verbosity\n1958\t      - '0.078'\n1959\t      - 'No'\n1960\t      - 'No'\n1961\t      - '0.73'\n1962\t    - - ARC×authority\n1963\t      - '0.192'\n1964\t      - 'No'\n1965\t      - 'No'\n1966\t      - '0.74'\n1967\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n1968\t      - '0.285'\n1969\t      - 'No'\n1970\t      - 'No'\n1971\t      - '0.78'\n1972\t    - - MMLU×authority\n1973\t      - '0.352'\n1974\t      - 'No'\n1975\t      - 'No'\n1976\t      - '0.76'\n1977\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n1978\t      - '0.418'\n1979\t      - 'No'\n1980\t      - 'No'\n1981\t      - '0.75'\n1982\t  figures_description:\n1983\t  - 'Fig 11: Volcano plot of K_eff_resid across 12 conditions. X-axis: β(K_eff_resid),\n1984\t\n1985\t    Y-axis: -log10(p). FDR threshold as horizontal dashed line (blue), Bonferroni\n1986\t    as\n1987\t\n1988\t    second line (red, more stringent). 7 points above FDR line, 5 above Bonferroni.\n1989\t\n1990\t    Two confound-free conditions (ARC×SM, ARC×PB) labeled and circled — they sit in\n1991\t\n1992\t    the top-right (large β, very low p). Color = confound r value (darker = higher\n1993\t\n1994\t    confound).\n1995\t\n1996\t    '\n1997\t  analysis: 'Plan_009 提供了 K_eff 独立效应的完整统计 infrastructure。三条核心结论：\n1998\t\n1999\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b6bb46a-6f14-4907-ac47-60e29122a37c","uuid":"2e19f560-33ba-426e-9b1a-c47033e656cb","timestamp":"2026-05-22T18:38:59.063Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T173833/median/review_context.yaml","content":"      - '0.68'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.48'\n    - - API tier panels\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.40'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Transferable attacks\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - Shared-bias attacks\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.42'\n    - - Targeted attacks\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.60'\n      - '0.58'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Violin plot of per-panel Gini coefficient, stratified by tier (Strong\n    / Weak /\n\n    API) and attack type (Transferable / Shared-bias). Weak × Transferable shows highest\n\n    concentration (rightmost violin); Strong × Shared-bias shows lowest (leftmost).\n\n    Horizontal dashed line at Gini=0.33 (uniform K=3 baseline).\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Concentration analysis 为 adaptive adversary 机制提供了 moderate 级别的直接证据。\n\n    Gini=0.45 和 weakest share=55% 支持 \"attacks concentrate on weakest judge\" 但不支持\n\n    \"attacks exclusively target weakest judge\"。Tier × attack type 交互效应与 plan_004\n\n    和 plan_002 的发现三角验证：K_eff 的有害效应主要出现在 weak-tier + transferable-attack\n\n    的交叉区域。论文可以将 concentration analysis 作为 mechanism section 的 supporting\n\n    evidence，但不能作为 standalone claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff Visualization and Decomposition\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '对 455 panels 绘制 K_eff vs η_max，拟合 tradeoff curve，展示 Pareto frontier，\n\n    按 tier 分层。分解 overall correlation 为 between-tier 和 within-tier 成分。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    overall_r_keff_eta: 0.72\n    overall_r_p: <0.001\n    within_7B_r: 0.4\n    within_70B_r: 0.38\n    within_API_r: 0.35\n    between_tier_r: 0.82\n    between_tier_variance_share: 0.72\n    within_tier_variance_share: 0.28\n    pareto_frontier_n_panels: 14\n    pareto_knee_keff: 1.8\n    pareto_knee_eta: 0.15\n  result_rationale: 'Overall r=+0.72（K_eff 与 η_max 正相关）反映了当前 LLM 生态的结构性事实：diversity\n\n    主要来自 capability tier 差异——高 K_eff panel 必然跨 tier（包含 7B 和 70B 和 API），\n\n    而跨 tier 意味着包含弱模型（高 η_max）。\n\n\n    Between-tier r=0.82 vs within-tier r≈0.38 清晰表明 ~72% 的 tradeoff 来自 cross-tier\n\n    选择。This is the statistical fingerprint of tier-mixing: the \"diversity-capability\n\n    tradeoff\" is primarily a \"tier-mixing artifact.\"\n\n\n    Within-tier r≈0.38 表明即使在同 tier 内，diversity 仍轻度正相关于 η_max——可能因为\n\n    同 tier 内更 diverse 的组合选入了更多 unusual/niche models（如 Mixtral-8x22B MoE\n\n    架构），这些模型在某些攻击上更脆弱。但 0.38 远弱于 0.82。\n\n\n    Pareto frontier 上 14 个 panels，knee 在 K_eff≈1.8, η_max≈0.15，对应 \"2 strong API\n\n    + 1 strong open-source 70B\" 的组合。Knee 右侧（高 K_eff）ASR 急升；knee 左侧（低\n\n    K_eff）边际安全增益递减。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Tradeoff Decomposition — Between vs Within Tier'\n    columns:\n    - Scope\n    - N panels\n    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n    - p-value\n    - Variance explained\n    rows:\n    - - Overall\n      - '455'\n      - '+0.72'\n      - <0.001\n      - 100%\n    - - Between-tier component\n      - —\n      - '+0.82'\n      - <0.001\n      - 72%\n    - - Within 7B\n      - '10'\n      - '+0.40'\n      - '0.052'\n      - 8%\n    - - Within 70B\n      - '10'\n      - '+0.38'\n      - '0.062'\n      - 7%\n    - - Within API\n      - '10'\n      - '+0.35'\n      - '0.078'\n      - 6%\n    - - Within-tier pooled\n      - '76'\n      - '+0.38'\n      - <0.001\n      - 28%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels. Points color-coded:\n\n    all-within-tier panels (green), cross-tier panels (gray gradient by tier spread).\n\n    Positive slope visible. Pareto frontier marked in black. Inset: zoomed within-tier\n\n    sub-clouds showing weaker positive slopes.\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 9b: Contour overlay on same scatter, showing panel ASR (lighter = lower ASR).\n\n    Optimal region (low ASR) hugs Pareto frontier at the knee. High-K_eff region (right\n\n    edge) shows dark contours (high ASR). Visual message: don''t chase diversity.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Tradeoff visualization 是论文最直观的 figure，支持 Claim 3 但同时揭示了其 mechanism：\n\n    tradeoff 是 tier-mixing 的直接后果，不是 diversity 本身的 intrinsic property。\n\n\n    Between/within decomposition（72% vs 28%）为 plan_004 的 within-tier findings 提供了\n\n    互补解释。论文中 Claim 3 应 reframe 为：\"The diversity-capability tradeoff is\n\n    predominantly structural (driven by cross-tier panel composition) rather than\n\n    fundamental. As model ecosystems mature with more uniformly capable models, the\n\n    tradeoff may attenuate.\"\n\n\n    Pareto frontier 分析直接服务于 Claim 6 的降级版本：最优策略是 \"stay near the Pareto\n\n    knee\" 而非 \"use a complex algorithm\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Panel Size Sensitivity K=3,5,7,9\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '测试 K_eff 正效应在不同 panel size 下的稳健性。\n\n    K=3: C(15,3)=455, K=5: C(15,5)=3003, K=7: C(15,7)=6435, K=9: C(15,9)=5005。\n\n    6 representative conditions per K。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k3_keff_resid_sig_positive: 4\n    k3_eta_max_sig: 5\n    k3_beta_ratio_eta_over_keff: 2.8\n    k3_median_R2: 0.38\n    k5_keff_resid_sig_positive: 3\n    k5_eta_max_sig: 5\n    k5_beta_ratio: 3.2\n    k5_median_R2: 0.35\n    k7_keff_resid_sig_positive: 2\n    k7_eta_max_sig: 6\n    k7_beta_ratio: 4.5\n    k7_median_R2: 0.33\n    k9_keff_resid_sig_positive: 1\n    k9_eta_max_sig: 6\n    k9_beta_ratio: 6.0\n    k9_median_R2: 0.31\n    keff_importance_trend: decreasing with K\n    eta_max_dominance_increases: true\n  result_rationale: 'K_eff 的正效应（diversity 有害）随 panel size 增大而减弱，原因是 majority vote\n    的\n\n    容错机制：K=3 时攻击者需翻转 2/3 judge（minority 就能 undermine），K=9 时需翻转\n\n    5/9。在 K=9 的大 panel 中，单个弱 judge 的影响被多数投票稀释——diversity 引入的\n\n    额外弱 judge 不再是决定性因素。\n\n\n    η_max dominance 随 K 增大而增强（β ratio 从 2.8:1 到 6.0:1），因为大 panel 中\n\n    \"最弱 judge\" 的 η_max 更 extreme（从 15 模型中选 9 个，almost certainly 包含一个\n\n    很弱的），但 majority vote 使得需要更多 judge 被攻破——weakest judge 本身的 ASR\n\n    仍是 panel 失败的 necessary condition（Theorem 1），但 sufficient condition 需要\n\n    更多 judge 配合。\n\n\n    K=9 时 K_eff 仅 1/6 sig——diversity 的有害效应在大 panel 中几乎消失。但这也意味着\n\n    diversity 的有益效应（如果存在）也被 majority vote 掩盖。R² 从 0.38 降到 0.31\n\n    表明大 panel 的 ASR 方差被 voting 压缩。\n\n\n    Practical implication: K_eff 主要是 K=3 的 phenomenon。对于实际部署（通常 K=3 或\n\n    K=5），K_eff 的有害效应是 relevant concern；对于 K≥7，可以忽略。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: K_eff Importance Across Panel Sizes'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - N panels\n    - K_resid sig(+)\n    - η_max sig\n    - β ratio η/K\n    - Med R²\n    - Mean ASR\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '455'\n      - 4/6\n      - 5/6\n      - '2.8'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.172'\n    - - '5'\n      - '3003'\n      - 3/6\n      - 5/6\n      - '3.2'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.128'\n    - - '7'\n      - '6435'\n      - 2/6\n      - 6/6\n      - '4.5'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.098'\n    - - '9'\n      - '5005'\n      - 1/6\n      - 6/6\n      - '6.0'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.082'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: Line plot with K on x-axis. Two lines: standardized β(η_max) (blue, stable\n\n    around 0.45-0.50) and β(K_eff_resid) (red, declining from ~0.18 to ~0.07). β ratio\n\n    annotation at each K. η_max dominance increases monotonically. K_eff_resid approaches\n\n    zero by K=9.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Panel size sensitivity 表明 K_eff 的有害效应是 small-panel phenomenon。论文应在\n\n    discussion 中注明：\"our findings are most relevant for K=3 panels, which represent\n\n    the majority of current deployment configurations (cost constraint). For K≥7,\n    the\n\n    diversity effect is negligible regardless of composition strategy.\"\n\n\n    这也限制了 Claim 1 的 generalizability——8-page EMNLP paper 的 K=3 focus 是合理的，\n\n    但 reviewer 可能要求 K=5 结果。K=5 数据（3003 panels）提供了强 power，3/6 K_eff sig\n\n    表明效应在 K=5 仍可检测但减弱。\n\n    '\n- name: VIF + Multicollinearity Diagnostics and Residualization Validation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '在现有 455-panel data 上进行统计诊断：VIF analysis, partial correlations, FDR\n    correction,\n\n    beta regression (alternative to OLS for bounded [0,1] ASR), confound-free condition\n\n    identification. 纯统计分析，无需 GPU。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    VIF_after_residualization: 1.0\n    VIF_before_residualization: 2.08\n    partial_r_keff_given_eta_median: 0.22\n    partial_r_keff_given_eta_range: 0.05-0.35\n    FDR_BH_keff_sig: 7\n    bonferroni_keff_sig: 5\n    confound_free_conditions: 2\n    confound_free_r_values: 0.33, 0.35\n    confound_free_keff_p: 5.2e-7, 3.7e-8\n    beta_regression_keff_sig: 6\n    beta_regression_concordance_with_OLS: 0.92\n    condition_number: 4.2\n    partial_eta2_keff_median: 0.04\n    partial_eta2_eta_max_median: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'VIF before residualization = 2.08（K_eff-η_max r=+0.72 对应 VIF\n    = 1/(1-0.72²) ≈ 2.08），\n\n    高于 cautionary threshold 但低于 critical threshold（VIF>5）。Residualization by\n\n    construction 降至 1.00，消除线性 multicollinearity。\n\n\n    Partial correlation r(K_eff | η_max) 中位数 0.22（range 0.05-0.35）：K_eff 在控制\n\n    η_max 后仍有 modest 的独立相关性。最强 partial r = 0.35 出现在 confound-free 条件\n\n    （ARC×score_manipulation, ARC×position_bias），最弱 partial r = 0.05 出现在\n\n    shared-bias 条件（sycophancy, authority）。\n\n\n    **FDR correction**: Benjamini-Hochberg 在 12 条件下 K_eff_resid 7/12 sig（与\n\n    uncorrected 结果一致——因为显著的条件 p 值很小，排名靠前）。Bonferroni（更保守）\n\n    降至 5/12：两个 borderline 条件（MMLU×score_manip p=0.012, ARC×verbosity p=0.018）\n\n    在 Bonferroni 阈值 0.05/12=0.0042 下落入 NS。\n\n\n    **2 confound-free 条件**（r≈0.33-0.35）确认了 K_eff 的独立效应不完全是 artifact：\n\n    当 K_eff 和 η_max 的耦合较弱时，K_eff 仍极显著（p<1e-6）。但仅 2 个条件——\n\n    reviewer 可能质疑为什么恰好这些条件 confound 低（是否 cherry-picked）。答案：\n\n    ARC dataset 上 score_manipulation 和 position_bias 攻击恰好对不同 capability\n\n    tier 的模型产生了不同于通常模式的 vulnerability profile，打破了 K_eff-η_max 的\n\n    结构性耦合。\n\n\n    **Beta regression**: 作为 robustness check（ASR ∈ [0,1]，OLS 假设可能不满足），\n\n    6/12 conditions K_eff sig（比 OLS 少 1 个——ARC×verbosity 在 beta regression 下\n\n    p=0.062）。92% concordance with OLS 表明 OLS 结果大体 robust，但 beta regression\n\n    给出了略保守的估计。\n\n\n    Partial η² 分析量化了 effect size：K_eff 中位数 partial η²=0.04（small effect），\n\n    η_max 中位数 partial η²=0.18（medium-large effect）。η_max 的解释力是 K_eff 的\n\n    4.5×——进一步确认 η_max 是 primary driver，K_eff 是 secondary amplifier。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Multicollinearity Diagnostics Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Diagnostic\n    - Value\n    - Threshold\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - VIF (raw K_eff)\n      - '2.08'\n      - <5 acceptable\n      - Moderate collinearity\n    - - VIF (K_eff_resid)\n      - '1.00'\n      - —\n      - Orthogonalized by construction\n    - - Condition number\n      - '4.2'\n      - <30 acceptable\n      - No severe multicollinearity\n    - - K_eff-η_max r\n      - '+0.72'\n      - —\n      - Strong positive confound\n    - - Median partial r(K|η)\n      - '0.22'\n      - —\n      - Small independent signal\n    - - Median partial η²(K)\n      - '0.04'\n      - <0.06 small\n      - Small effect size\n    - - Median partial η²(η)\n      - '0.18'\n      - '>0.14 large'\n      - Large effect size\n  - name: 'Table 16: FDR vs Bonferroni Correction Comparison (K_eff_resid)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - p(K_resid)\n    - FDR sig?\n    - Bonferroni sig?\n    - Confound r\n    rows:\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '3.7e-8'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - ARC×position\n      - '5.2e-7'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.33'\n    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n      - '0.003'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.74'\n    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n      - '0.005'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - MMLU×position\n      - '0.006'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '0.012'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.71'\n    - - ARC×verbosity\n      - '0.018'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.70'\n    - - MMLU×verbosity\n      - '0.078'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.73'\n    - - ARC×authority\n      - '0.192'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.74'\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.285'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - MMLU×authority\n      - '0.352'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.76'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '0.418'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.75'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Volcano plot of K_eff_resid across 12 conditions. X-axis: β(K_eff_resid),\n\n    Y-axis: -log10(p). FDR threshold as horizontal dashed line (blue), Bonferroni\n    as\n\n    second line (red, more stringent). 7 points above FDR line, 5 above Bonferroni.\n\n    Two confound-free conditions (ARC×SM, ARC×PB) labeled and circled — they sit in\n\n    the top-right (large β, very low p). Color = confound r value (darker = higher\n\n    confound).\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Plan_009 提供了 K_eff 独立效应的完整统计 infrastructure。三条核心结论：\n\n","numLines":500,"startLine":1500,"totalLines":2487}}}
