{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X9Zxc3pe3uPHHXw9EfpbGA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# cert_manip_resist_eval — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 18:20 UTC | 更新原因: P2 aggregation complete (D016); Claim 7 revised; all P0-P2 analyses done\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**The Diversity Trap**：LLM judge panel diversity 在 adaptive adversary 下 predominantly 增加脆弱性（K_eff 7/12 正, 1/12 负）。η_max (11/12) 是更一致的驱动因子，K_eff 条件依赖。详见 paper_framing.md v4b。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — 全部 15-model 分析完成（P0-P2），论文写作推进中\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- ✅ 126/126 API scoring + 455 panels pipeline\\\\n- ✅ Dominance analysis canonical table（log-log OLS）\\\\n- ✅ η_max **11/12** FDR sig\\\\n- ✅ K_eff 7/12 positive, 1/12 negative (sycophancy), 4/12 NS\\\\n- ✅ Copula Claim 5 证伪移除 (D015)\\\\n- ✅ Family Labels 15-model 确认 (Claim 4 maintained)\\\\n- ✅ **P2 Aggregation 完成 (D016)**: Bayesian 抑制 K_eff (12/12→5/12) 但 η_max 不变 (12/12); 原 Claim 7 修正\\\\n- ✅ Paper Agent: Introduction + Threat Model v4b 数字统一\\\\n- 📌 Dream simulation (dream_20260522T173833) — writing 阶段\\\\n- 📌 Paper Agent: Methodology + Results 章节\\\\n\\\\n## 关键数据（唯一来源: dominance analysis, log-log OLS）\\\\n| Metric | Value |\\\\n|--------|-------|\\\\n| η_max FDR sig | **11/12** (only NS: arc×position) |\\\\n| K_eff FDR sig + | **7/12** |\\\\n| K_eff FDR sig − | **1/12** (arc×sycophancy) |\\\\n| K_eff NS | **4/12** |\\\\n| η_max dominant | **4/12** |\\\\n| Co-dominant | **7/12** |\\\\n| K_eff dominant | **1/12** (arc×position) |\\\\n| Regression spec | log(ASR+ε) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max+ε) |\\\\n\\\\n### Aggregation 效应 (P2, D016)\\\\n| Method | η_max sig | K_eff sig | K_eff β方向 | R² |\\\\n|--------|-----------|-----------|------------|-----|\\\\n| majority_vote | 12/12 | 12/12 | 全正 | 0.433 |\\\\n| weighted