{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KunJX5rTADKRV5GXmbahEB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# cert_manip_resist_eval — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 18:40 UTC | 更新原因: P2b log-log canonical done (D017); Claim 6 15-model confirmed (12/12); registry updated\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**The Diversity Trap**：LLM judge panel diversity 在 adaptive adversary 下 predominantly 增加脆弱性（K_eff 7/12 正, 1/12 负）。η_max (11/12) 是更一致的驱动因子，K_eff 条件依赖。详见 paper_framing.md v4b+D017。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — 全部 15-model 分析完成（P0-P2b），论文写作 + 修正推进中\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- ✅ 126/126 API scoring + 455 panels pipeline\\\\n- ✅ Dominance analysis canonical table（log-log OLS）\\\\n- ✅ η_max **11/12**, K_eff 7/12+, 1/12−, 4/12 NS\\\\n- ✅ Copula Claim 5 证伪移除 (D015)\\\\n- ✅ Family Labels 15-model 确认 (Claim 4)\\\\n- ✅ **P2b Aggregation log-log canonical (D017)**: Bayesian 部分减弱两个通道（η_max 11→9/12, K_eff 翻负 4/5）; Threshold R²=0.90\\\\n- ✅ **Claim 6 Panel Design 15-model**: min(η_max) **12/12** 全胜（from 5/6）\\\\n- ✅ Registry plan001_step1_full_v4 marked DONE\\\\n- 📌 Paper Agent: methodology.tex critical 修正中（模型名称 + MI 方法描述）\\\\n- 📌 Dream simulation (dream_20260522T173833) — writing 阶段\\\\n\\\\n## 关键数据（唯一来源: dominance analysis, log-log OLS）\\\\n| Metric | Value |\\\\n|--------|-------|\\\\n| η_max FDR sig | **11/12** (only NS: arc×position) |\\\\n| K_eff FDR sig + | **7/12** |\\\\n| K_eff FDR sig − | **1/12** (arc×sycophancy) |\\\\n| K_eff NS | **4/12** |\\\\n| Regression spec | log(ASR+ε) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max+ε) |\\\\n\\\\n### Aggregation 效应 (P2b log-log canonical, D017)\\\\n| Method | η_max sig | K_eff sig | K_eff +/− | R² |\\\\n|--------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----|\\\\n| majority | 11/12 | 8/12 | 7+/1− | 0.376 |\\\\n| weighted | 11/12 | 11/12 | 11+/0− | 0.357 |\\\\n| threshold | 12/12 | 11/12 | 10+/1− | **0.901** |\\\\n| bayesian | **9/12** | 5/12 | 1+/**4−** | 0.105 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] P0-P2b: 全部 15-model 分析完成\\\\n- [x] Claim 6: 15-model panel design 验证 (12/12)\\\\n- [x] Registry 更新\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: methodology critical 修正\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: Results 章节（含 P2b aggregation 最终数据）\\\\n- [ ] Dream report 处理\\\\n- [ ] Agent: 提供完整 15 模型列表（供 Paper Agent 修正 §3.1）\\\\n- [ ] Theorem 1 scope 更新\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nseetacloud-rtx6000: 4× RTX 6000 96G（全空闲，写作阶段）\\\\n\\\\n## 目标\\\\nEMNLP 2026 via ARR | Contribution stack: 7 items | All analyses complete | Paper writing in progress\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-22 | Claim 7 final (log-log canonical): Bayesian partia | plan001_step1_full_v4 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-22 | Claim 7 revised: \\\\\\\"Bayesian breaks weakest-link\\\\\\\" fa | plan001_step1_full_v4 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-22 | Claim 5 (Gaussian Copula Failure) falsified at 15- | worker_analysis_15model-family-copula |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-22 | 15-model 结果证伪原始 Claim 1 (\\\\\\\"K_eff irrelevant\\\\\\\")；K_eff | plan001_step1_full_v4 |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-22 | 7-model 预览显示 Claim 2 复活信号：random-fault K_eff gains | plan_001_7model_preview |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-22 | Plan_010 聚合实验完成：Bayesian 部分打破 weakest-link (3/12 v | plan_010 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-22 | Plan_003 BFT contrast failed (0/12 random-fault K_ | plan_003 |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-22 | Dream review (2.5 all tiers) exposed 13 structural | — |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-22 | Taxonomy 验证失败（0/6 新条件 K_eff 显著），建议 kill 项目 | taxonomy-broad-spectrum |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-22 | MVP 原假设部分证伪：K_eff 仅对 shared-bias attacks 显著，η_max  | mvp-step2v3-retry3 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3146, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AfraqM1gscS8e9AddmhuYW","session_id":"6b6bb46a-6f14-4907-ac47-60e29122a37c","uuid":